<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1CH" style="id">1 Chronicles</book>
  <para style="h">1 Chronicles</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Chronicles</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Chronicles</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Chronicles</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Adama, Setha, Enosa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kenana, Mahalalela, Jareda,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Enoka, Methusela, Lameka,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nova, Sema, Hama, Japhetha-te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Japhetha fapate chu Gomera te, Magoga te, Madaia te, Javana te, Tubala te, Meseka te, Tirasa te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gomera fapate chu Askenaza te, Diphatha te, Togarma te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Javana fapate chu Elisa te, Tarsisa te, Kittima te, Rodanima te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hama fapate chu Kusa te, Mizraima te, Puta te, Kanaana te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kusa fapate chu Seba te, Havila te, Sabta te, Raama te, Sabteka te an ni. Raama fapate chu Seba te, Dedana te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kusan Nimroda a hring a; ani chu leia mi chak huaisen lo awm ṭanna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mizraiman Ludima te, Anamima te, Lehabima te, Naphtuhima te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathrusima te, Kasluhima te (chu mi lakah chuan Philistia-ho hi an lo chhuak a ni), Kaphtorima te a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kanaana chuan Zidona, a fa tîr leh Hetha te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jebus-ho te, Amor-ho te, Girgas-ho te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hiv-ho te, Ark-ho te, Sin-ho te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Arvad-ho te, Zemar-ho te, Hamath-ho te a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sema fapate chu Elama te, Asura te, Arpaksada te, Luda te, Arama te, Uza te, Hula te, Gethera te, Meseka te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Arpaksada chuan Sela a hring a; tin, Sela chuan Ebera a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ebera lakah chuan fapa pahnih an piang a: pakhata hming chu Pelega a ni a, a dam laiin lei hi ṭhena a awm avângin; a unaupa hming chu Joktana a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Joktana chuan Almodada te, Selepha te, Hazarmavetha te, Jera te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hadorama te, Uzala te, Dikla te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ebala te, Abimaela te, Seba te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ophira te, Havila te, Jobaba te a hring a. Chûng zawng zawng chu Joktana thlahte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sema te, Arpaksada te, Sela te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ebera te, Pelega te, Reuva te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Seruga te, Nahora te, Tera te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Abrama te (chu chu Abrahama a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Abrahama fapate chu Isaaka te, Ismaela te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hêngte hi an thlahte chu an ni: Ismaela fa tîr chu Nebaiotha a ni a; tin, Kedara te, Adbeela te, Mibsama te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Misma te, Duma te, Masa te, Hadada te, Tema te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jetura te, Naphisa te, Kedema te. Chûngte chu Ismaela thlahte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Abrahama hmei Keturi fapate chu Zimrana te, Joksana te, Medana te, Midiana te, Isbaka te, Suaha te an ni. Joksana fapate chu Seba leh Dedana an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Midiana fapate chu Epha te, Ephera te, Hanoka te, Abida te, Elda te an ni. Chûng zawng zawng chu Keturi fapate an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Abrahaman Isaaka a hring a. Isaaka fapate chu Esauva leh Israela an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Esauva fapate chu Eliphaza te, Reuela te, Jeusa te, Jalama te, Kora te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Eliphaza fapate chu Temana te, Omara te, Zephia te, Gatama te, Kenaza te, Timna te, Amaleka te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Reuela fapate chu Nahatha te, Zera te, Sama te, Miza te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, Seira fapate chu Lotana te, Sobala te, Zibeona te, Ana te, Disona te, Ezera te, Disana te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, Lotana fapate chu Horia leh Homama an ni a; tin, Lotana chuan farnu Timni a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Sobala fapate chu Aliana te, Manatha te, Ebala te, Sephia te, Onama te an ni. Zibeona fapate chu Aia leh Ana an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ana fapa chu Disona a ni. Disona fapate chu Hamrana te, Esbana te, Ithrana te, Kerana te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ezera fapate chu Bilhana te, Zaavana te, Jaakana te an ni. Disana fapate chu Uza leh Arana an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Israela thlahte chunga lal an la awm hmaa Edom ram lalte chu hêngte hi an ni: Beora fapa Bela a ni a, a khawpui hming chu Dinhaba a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, Bela chu a thi a, Bozra khuaa mi Zera fapa Jobaba chu a aiah a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, Jobaba chu a thi a, Teman-ho rama mi Husama a aiah a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, Husama chu a thi a, Bedada fapa Hadada, Moab phûla Midian-ho thattu kha a aiah a lal ta a. A khawpui hming chu Avith a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, Hadada chu a thi a, Masreka mi Samla a aiah a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, Samla chu a thi a, Luipui kama Rehoboth khuaa mi Saula a aiah a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tin, Saula chu a thi a, Akbora fapa Baal-hanana a aiah a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tin, Baal-hanana chu a thi a, Hadada a aiah a lal ta a; a khawpui hming chu Pai a ni. A nupui hming chu Mezahaba fanu Matredi fanu Mehetabeli a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Hadada pawh chu a thi a. Tin, Edom-ho hotute chu hotu Timna te, hotu Alia te, hotu Jethetha te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />hotu Oholibama te, hotu Ela te, hotu Pinona te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />hotu Kenaza te, hotu Temana te, hotu Mibzara te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />hotu Magdiela te, hotu Irama te an ni. Chûng chu Edom-ho hotute an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hêngte hi Israela fapate chu an ni: Reubena, Simeona, Levia, Juda, Isakara, Zebuluna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dana, Josefa, Benjamina, Naphtalia, Gada, Asera.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Juda fapate chu Era, Onana, Sela-te an ni. Chûng mite pathum chu Kanaan mi Bathsuii laka piang an ni. Tin, Juda fa tîr Era chu Lalpa mit hmuhin mi sual a ni a; tichuan, a tihlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, a monu Tamari chuan Pereza leh Zera a hrinsak a. Juda fapate zawng zawng chu panga an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pereza fapate chu Hezrona leh Hamula an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Zera fapate chu Zimria te, Ethana te, Hemana te, Kalkola te, Dara te an ni a, an vaiin panga an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Karmia fapa chu Akara, Israel-te tibuaitu, thilhlan bawhchhetupa kha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Ethana fapa chu Azaria a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hezrona fapate, a laka piangte chu Jerameela te, Rama te, Kelubaia te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Raman Aminadaba a hring a; tin, Aminadaban Juda thlah mi lian Nasona a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nasonan Salma a hring a, Salman Boaza a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Boazan Obeda a hring a, Obedan Jesaia a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesaian a fa tîrah Eliaba a hring a, a pahnihna chu Abinadaba, a pathumna chu Simea,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a palina chu Nethanela, a pangana chu Radaia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a parukna chu Ozema, a pasarihna chu Davida a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, an farnute chu Zeruii leh Abigaili an ni. Tin, Zeruii fapate chu Abisaia te, Joaba te, Asahela te an ni a, pathum an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abigailin Amasa a hring a; tin, Amasa pa chu Ismael mi Jethera a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hezrona fapa Kaleban a nupui Azubi, Jeriothi fanu lakah chuan fate a hring a. Tin, hêngte hi a fapate chu an ni: Jesera, Sobaba, Ardona.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Azubi chu a thi a, Kaleba chuan Ephrathi a nei a, ani chuan Hura a hrinsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Hura chuan Uria a hring a, Urian Bezalela a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, chumi hnuah chuan Hezrona chuan Gileada pa Makira fanu a pâwl a, kum sawmruk a nihin chu mi chu a nei a; ani chuan Seguba a hrinsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Seguba chuan Jaira a hring a, ani chuan Gilead ramah khawpui sawmhnih leh pathum a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Gesura leh Arama chuan Jaira khawpuite, Kenath khua leh a khawperte nên, khaw sawmruk an lâksak a. Chûng zawng zawng chu Gileada pa Makira fapate chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin Kaleb-ephratha khuaa Hezrona a thih hnu chuan Hezrona nupui Abiji chuan Tekoa pa Asura a hrinsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Hezrona fa tîr Jerameela fapa upa ber chu Rama a ni a; tin, Buna te, Orena te, Ozema te, Ahija te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jerameela chuan nupui dang a nei a, a hming chu Atari a ni a, Onama nu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerameela fapa upa ber Rama fapate chu Maaza te, Jamina te, Ekera te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Onama fapate chu Samaia leh Jada an ni a. Samaia fapate chu Nadaba leh Abisura an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Abisura nupuia hming chu Abihaili a ni a; tin, ani chuan Abana leh Molida a hrinsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nadaba fapate chu Seleda leh Apaima an ni; Seleda erawh chu fa nei lovin a thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Apaima fapa chu Isia a ni a, Isia fapa chu Sesana a ni a, Sesana fapa chu Alaia a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Samaia unaupa Jada fapate chu Jethera leh Jonathana an ni a; Jethera chu fa nei lovin a thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Jonathana fapate chu Peletha leh Zaza an ni. Chûngte chu Jerameela thlahte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Sesana chuan fanute tih loh chu fa a nei lo va. Tin, Sesana chuan Aigupta mi chhiahhlawh a nei a, a hming chu Jara a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Sesana chuan a fanu chu a chhiahhlawh Jara nupuiah a neihtîr a; tin, Ataia a hrinsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ataia chuan Nathana a hring a, Nathana chuan Zabada a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Zabada chuan Ephlala a hring a, Ephlala chuan Obeda a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Obeda chuan Jehua a hring a, Jehua chuan Azaria a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Azaria chuan Heleza a hring a, Heleza chuan Eleasa a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Eleasa chuan Sismaia a hring a, Sismaia chuan Saluma a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Saluma chuan Jekamia a hring a, Jekamia chuan Elisama a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jerameela unaupa Kaleba fa tîr chu Ziph-ho thlahtu Mesa a ni a, a fapa Maresa chu Hebrona pa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hebrona fapate chu Kora te, Tapua te, Rekema te, Sema te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Seman Jorkeama pa Rahama a hring a; tin, Rekeman Samaia a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Samaia fapa chu Maona a ni a; tin, Maona chu Beth-zura pa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Kaleba hmei Ephi chuan Harana te, Moza te, Gazeza te a hring a; Harana chuan Gazeza a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Jadaia fapate chu Regema te, Jothama te, Gesana te, Peletha te, Epha te, Saapha te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Kaleba hmei Maaki chuan Sebera leh Tirhana a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Madmana pa Saapha leh Makbena leh Gibea pa Seva a hring bawk a; tin, Kaleba fanu chu Aksi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Hêngte hi Kaleba thlahte an ni: Hura fa, Kiriath-jearim-ho thlahtu, Ephrathi fa tîr Sobala;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Bethlehem-ho thlahtu Salma; Beth-gader-ho thlahtu Harepha te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tin, Kiriath-jearim-ho thlahtu Sobala chuan Haroe-ho leh Menuhoth-ho zâtve a thlah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tin, Kiriath-jearim hnamte chu Ithra-ho te, Puth-ho te, Sumath-ho te, Misra-ho te an ni; chûngho aṭang chuan Zorath-ho te leh Estaol-ho te an lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Salma thlahte chu Bethlehem-ho te, Netophath-ho te, Atroth-beth-joab-ho te, Manahath-ho zâtve te, Zor-ho te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tin, Jabez-a awm lehkhaziaktu hnamte chu Tirath-ho te, Simeath-ho te, Sukath-ho te an ni. Chûngte chu Rekaba thlahte zînga mi Hamatha thlah Ken-hote chu an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, hêngte hi Davida fapa, Hebron khuaa a hrinte chu an ni: a fa tîr chu Jezreel khuaa Ahinoami laka mi Amnona a ni a; a dawttu chu Karmel khua Abigaili laka mi Daniela a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a pathumna chu Gesur lal Talmaia fanu Maaki fapa Absaloma a ni a; a palina chu Hagithi fapa Adonija a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a pangana chu Abitali laka mi Sephatia a ni a; a parukna chu a nupui Egli laka mi Ithreama a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hebron khuaah chuan paruk a hring a. Chutah chuan kum sarih leh thla ruk a lal a; tin, Jerusalem khuaah kum sawmthum leh kum thum a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem khuaa a hrinte chu: Simea te, Sobaba te, Nathana te, Solomona te an ni a; an pali chuan Amiela fanu Bathsuii laka mi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Ibhara te, Elisama te, Elipheleta te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Noga te, Nephega te, Japhia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Elisama te, Eliada te, Elipheleta te - pakua an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chûng zawng zawngte chu Davida fapate an ni, hmei fate tiam lovin; tin, Tamari chu an farnu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Solomona fapa chu Rehoboama a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Abija a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Asa a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Jehosaphata a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />chu mi fapa chu Jorama a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Ahazia a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Joasa a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />chu mi fapa chu Amazia a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Azaria a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Jothama a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />chu mi fapa chu Ahaza a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Hezekia a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Manasea a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />chu mi fapa chu Amona a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Josia a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Josia fapate chu a fa tîr chu Johanana a ni a, a dawttu chu Jehoiakima a ni a, a pathumna chu Zedekia a ni a, a palina chu Saluma a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jehoiakima fapate chu Jekonia leh Zedekia an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, sal tâng Jekonia fapate chu Sealtiela te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Malkirama te, Pedaia te, Senazara te, Jekamia te, Hosama te, Nedabia te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pedaia fapate chu Zerubabela leh Simeia an ni. Zerubabela fapate chu Mesulama leh Hanania an ni a, Selomithi chu an farnu a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tin, Hasuba te, Ohela te, Berekia te, Hasadia te, Jusab-heseda te - panga an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hanania fapa chu Pelatia a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Jesaia a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Rephaia a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Arnana a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Obadia a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Sekania a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sekania fapa chu Semaia a ni. Semaia fapate chu Hatusa te, Igala te, Baria te, Nearia te, Saphata te an ni a - paruk an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nearia fapate chu Elioenaia te, Hizkia te, Azrikama te an ni a - pathum an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Elioenaia fapate chu Hodavia te, Eliasiba te, Pelaia te, Akuba te, Johanana te, Delaia te, Anania te an ni a - pasarih an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda fapate chu Pereza te, Hezrona te, Karmia te, Hura te, Sobala te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Sobala fapa Reaian Jahatha a hring a; tin, Jahathan Ahumaia leh Lahada a hring a, chûng chu Zorath-ho hnamte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Etama pa fapate chu Jezreela te, Isma te, Idbasa te an ni a, an farnu hming chu Hazelelponi a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tin, Gedora pa Penuela leh Husa pa Ezera an ni. Chûngte chu Bethlehema pa, Ephrathi fa tîr, Hura thlahte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Tekoa pa Asura chuan nupui pahnih Heli leh Naari a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Naari chuan Ahuzama te, Hephera te, Temenia te, Haahastaria te a hrinsak a. Chûngte chu Naari fapate an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Heli fapate chu Zeretha te, Izara te, Ethnana te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Hakozan Anuba te, Zobeba te, Haruma fapa Aharlel-ho thlahte a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Jabeza chu a unaute aia mi zahawm a ni a, a nu chuan, “Lungngai chunga ka hrin a ni a,” tiin a hmingah Jabeza a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Jabeza chuan, “Aw, mal mi sâwm ngei ngei la, ka ramri hi mi zauh la, i kut chuan mi awmpuiin lungngaihna ka chungah a thlen loh nân sual lak ata mi thiarfihlîm ang che,” tiin Israel-te Pathian chu a au va. Tichuan, Pathianin a thil dîl chu a hlawhtlintîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Suha unaupa Keluban Mehira a hring a, chu mi chu Estona pa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Estona chuan Beth-rapha te, Pasea te, Ir-nahasa pa Tehina te a hring a. Chûngte chu Reka-hote an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kenaza fapate chu Othniela leh Seraia an ni. Othniela fapa chu Hathatha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Meonothaian Ophra a hring a; tin, Seraian Ge-harasim-ho thlahtu Joaba a hring a, chu mite chu kut themthiam mi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Jephunea fapa Kaleba fapate chu Irua te, Ela te, Naama te an ni a. Ela fapa chu Kenaza a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jehalelela fapate chu Zipa te, Zipha te, Tiria te, Asarela te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ezra fapate chu Jethera te, Mereda te, Ephera te, Jalona te an ni. Pharaoa fanu Bithiaii, Mereda nupui fapate chu Miriama te, Samaia te, Estemoa pa Isba te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, a nupui Juda hmeichhiain Gedora pa Jereda te, Sokoa pa Hebera te, Zanoa pa Jekuthiela te a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Nahama farnu Hodia nupuia fapate chu Garm-ho thlahtu Keila pa leh Maakath-ho thlahtu Estemoa an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Simona fapate chu Amnona te, Rina te, Ben-hanana te, Tilona te an ni. Tin, Isia fapate chu Zohetha leh Ben-zohetha an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Juda fapa Sela fapate chu Leka pa Era te, Maresa pa Laada te, Asbea-ho puan zai sîn siamtuhote an ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tin, Jokima te, Kozeba-ho te, Joasa te, Sarapha, Moab rama rorêla awma, chumi hnua Jasubi-lehem-a awm taa te kha an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chûng thuziak chu hmasânga mi a ni. Chûngho chu bêl vawtu, Netaim leh Gedera khuaa awm an ni a, lal hnênah a hna thawkin an awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Simeona fapate chu Nemuela te, Jamina te, Jariba te, Zera te, Saula te an ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Saula fapa chu Saluma a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Mibsama a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Misma a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Misma fapa chu Hamuela a ni a; chu mi fapa chu Zakura a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Simeia a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Simeia chuan fapa sâwm leh paruk leh fanu paruk a nei a; a unaute erawh chuan fa an ngah ve lo va, Juda thlahte angin an thlahte pawh an pung ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Beer-seba-ah te, Molada-ah te, Hazar-sual-ah te an awm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bilha-ah te, Ezem-ah te, Tolad-ah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bethuel-ah te, Horma-ah te, Ziglag-ah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Beth-markaboth-ah te, Hazar-susim-ah te, Beth-biri-ah te, Saraim-ah te pawh. Chûngte chu Davida lal thlenga an khawpuite chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, an khua chu khaw nga - Etam te, Ain te, Rimon te, Token te, Asan te a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />tin, chumi vêla khaw tê zawng zawng Baal thlengin a ni. Chûngte chu an chênna a ni a, an thlahtute thu ziakna an kawl bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Mesobaba te, Jamleka te, Amazia fapa Josa te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Joela te, Josibia fapa Jehua te (chu mite pa chu Asiela fapa Seraia a ni a),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Elioenaia te, Jaakoba te, Jesohaia te, Asaia te, Adiela te, Jesi-miela te, Benaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Siphia fapa Ziza te, chu mite pa chu Allona a ni a, chu mi chu Jedaia fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Simria fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Semaia fapa a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chûng an hming an lamte chu an chhûngkaw puipate an ni a, an chhûngkua chu nasa takin an lo pung ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, Gedor luhnaah, ruam chhak lampang thlengin an ran rualte tlatna tûr zawngin an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, ran tlatna hnim tui tak tak leh ṭha tak tak an hmu a, a ram chu a zauvin a reh a, râlmuanawm tak a ni; a hmaa lo awmte chu Hama thlahte an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tichuan, chûng an hming an ziakate chu Judai ram lal Hezekia lal lai khân an lût a, an puan inte leh chutih laia Meunim-ho lo awmte chu an tiboral vek a, tûn thlengin an hmun chu an luahsak a; an ran rual tân tlatna a awm avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, ṭhenkhat Simeona fapateho, mi zanga lai Seir tlângah an kal a, an hotu atân Isia fapate - Pelatia te, Nearia te, Rephaia te, Uziela te an hmang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tichuan, Amalek-ho hnam tlân bo la awmte kha an hneh a, tûn thlengin chutah chuan an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israela fa tîr Reubena fapate chu (ani chu fa tîr zawng a ni a; amaherawhchu, a pa khum a tihbawlhhlawh avângin a fa tîr nihna chu Israela fapa Josefa fapate pêk a ni a; tichuan, thlahtute chhuina chu fa tîr nihnaa chhui tûr a ni ta lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Juda chuan a unaute a khûm ta si a, amahah chuan mi lian chu a lo chhuak a, fa tîr nihna erawh chu Josefa chan a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israela fa tîr Reubena fapate chu Hanoka te, Palua te, Hezrona te, Karmia te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Joela fapa chu Semaia a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Goga a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Simeia a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />chu mi fapa chu Mika a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Reaia a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Baala a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />chu mi fapa chu Beera, Assuria lal Tiglath-pileseran sala a hruai chu a ni; ani chu Reuben-ho mi lian a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An thlahtute hnam chhui dâna a unaute hnam hotute chu Aroer aṭanga Nebo leh Baal-meon thlenga awm Jeiela te, Zekaria te, Bela te an ni; chu mi pa chu Azaza a ni a, chu mi pa chu Sema a ni a, chu mi pa chu Joela a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anni chuan chhak laman Euphrates lui aṭanga thlalêr luhna thlengin an luah a, Gilead ramah chuan an ran a lo pun tâk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Saula dam lai chuan Hagar-ho an rûn a, chûngho chu an kutah an lo tlâwm ta a; tichuan, Gilead chhak lam ram tluanin an puan inte an zâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Gada fapate chu an ep Basan raman Saleka thlengin an awm a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />hotu Joela te, a dawttu Saphama te, Janaia te, Basan-a mi Saphata te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />an chhûngte, an unau Mikaela te, Mesulama te, Seba te, Joraia te, Jakana te, Ziaa te, Ebera te nên pasarih an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hêngte hi Huria fapa Abihaila fapate an ni, chu mi chu Jaroa fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Gileada fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Mikaela fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Jesisaia fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Jadoa fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Buza fapa a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahia chu Abdiela fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Gunia fapa a ni a, an chhûngkaw hotu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, Gilead rama Basan-ah leh a khawpuiahte leh Saron dai vêl zawng zawng an ram chin thlengin an luah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chûng zawng zawng chu Judai ram lal Jothama lal lai leh Israel ram lal Jeroboama lal laia thlahtute chhuinaah ziak an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Reuben-ho te, Gad-ho te, Manase hnam zâtvete zînga huaisen ṭha ṭhiau, phaw leh kâwlhnâm keng thei, thal kah thiam, indo thiamte chu sîngli leh sângli leh zasarih leh sawmruk an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hagar-hote, Jetur-hote, Naphis-hote, Nodab-hote chu an do va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, ṭanpuiin an awm a; tichuan, Hagar-ho leh an hnêna awm zawng zawng chu an kutah pêk an ni ta a; indo lai chuan Pathian an au va, anni chu a lo chhâng a, amahah chuan rinna an nghah avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, an rante an mansak a; an sanghâwngsei sîngnga leh berâm nuai hnih leh sîngnga leh sabengtung sânghnih leh mihring nuai khat nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chu indo chu Pathian remtihpui a nih avângin mi tam tak an that a ni. Sal tân thlengin an awmna ram chu an luahsak ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Manasea thlah hnam zâtvete chu chumi ramah chuan an awm a; Basan aṭanga Baal-hermon te, Senir te, Hermon tlâng thlengin an sâwn zau zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, hêngte hi an chhûngkaw puipate chu an ni: Ephera te, Isia te, Eliela te, Azriela te, Jeremia te, Hodavia te, Jadiela te, mi chak huaisen, mi hmingthang, an pute chhûngkaw puipate chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, an pi leh pute Pathian chungah thil an tisual a, an hmaa Pathianin a lo tihboral tâk, chu rama mi pathiante lakah chuan an uire ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Israel-te Pathian chuan Assuria lal Pula (chu chu Assuria lal Tilgath-pilnesera) rilru chu a chawk tho va, ani chuan Reuben-ho te, Gad-ho te, Manase hnam zâtvete chu a man a, Hala-ah te, Habor-ah te, Hara-ah te, Gozan luiah te a hruai a, tûn thleng hian an la awm.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Levia fapate chu Gersona te, Kohatha te, Meraria te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Kohatha fapate chu Amrama te, Izara te, Hebrona te, Uziela te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Amrama thlahte chu Arona te, Mosia te, Miriami te an ni a. Tin, Arona fapate chu Nadaba te, Abihua te, Eleazara te, Ithamara te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eleazara chuan Phinehasa a hring a, Phinehasan Abisua a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abisuan Bukia a hring a, Bukian Uzia a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Uzian Zerahia a hring a, Zerahian Meraiotha a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Meraiothan Amaria a hring a, Amarian Ahituba a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahituban Zadoka a hring a, Zadokan Ahimaaza a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahimaazan Azaria a hring a, Azarian Johanana a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Johananan Azaria a hring a (chu mi chuan a ni, Jerusalem-a Solomona sak biak ina puithiam hna thawk ni);
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azarian Amaria a hring a, Amarian Ahituba a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahituban Zadoka a hring a, Zadokan Saluma a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Saluman Hilkia a hring a, Hilkian Azaria a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azarian Seraia a hring a, Seraian Jehozadaka a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpan Judai ram leh Jerusalem khua Nebukadnezzara kuta a pêk lai khân Jehozadaka chu salah a tâng ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Levia fapate chu Gersoma te, Kohatha te, Meraria te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hêng hi Gersoma fapate hming chu a ni: Libnia leh Simeia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kohatha fapate chu Amrama te, Izara te, Hebrona te, Uziela te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Meraria fapate chu Mahlia leh Musia an ni. Chûngte chu an chhûngkaw kal dân ang zêla Levi-ho hnamte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gersoma fapa chu Libnia a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Jahatha a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Zima a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />chu mi fapa chu Joa a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Idova a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Zera a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Jeatheraia a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kohatha thlahte chu: Aminadaba a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Kora a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Asira a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />chu mi fapa chu Elkana a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Ebiasapha a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Asira a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />chu mi fapa chu Tahatha a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Uriela a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Uzia a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Saula a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Elkana fapate chu: Amasaia leh Ahimotha an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Elkana thlahte chu: Elkana fapa chu Zophaia a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Nahatha a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />chu mi fapa chu Eliaba a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Jerohama a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Elkana a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Samuela fapate chu a upa zâwk chu Joela a ni a, a dawttu chu Abija a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Meraria fapa chu Mahlia a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Libnia a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Simeia a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Uza a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />chu mi fapa chu Simea a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Hagia a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Asaia a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chûngte chu a ni, bâwm dah hnua Lalpa ina hla hruaitu atâna Davidan a ruatte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tichuan, Solomonan Jerusalem-a Lalpa in a sak hma loh chu, inbiakna puan inah chuan hlain rawng an bâwl ṭhîn a, an inchhâwk kual ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, hêngte hi chûng hna thawktute chu an ni, an fapate nên, Kohath-ho thlahte chu: hla satu Hemana a ni a, chu mi pa chu Joela a ni a, chu mi pa chu Samuela a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />chu mi pa chu Elkana a ni a, chu mi pa chu Jerohama a ni a, chu mi pa chu Eliela a ni a, chu mi pa chu Tova a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />chu mi pa chu Zupha a ni a, chu mi pa chu Elkana a ni a, chu mi pa chu Mahatha a ni a, chu mi pa chu Amasaia a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />chu mi pa chu Elkana a ni a, chu mi pa chu Joela a ni a, chu mi pa chu Azaria a ni a, chu mi pa chu Zephania a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />chu mi pa chu Tahatha a ni a, chu mi pa chu Asira a ni a, chu mi pa chu Ebiasapha a ni a, chu mi pa chu Kora a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />chu mi pa chu Izara a ni a, chu mi pa chu Kohatha a ni a, chu mi pa chu Levia a ni a, chu mi pa chu Israela a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, a unaupa chu Asapha, a ding lama che ṭhîn a ni a, Asapha pa chu Berekia a ni a, chu mi pa chu Simea a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />chu mi pa chu Mikaela a ni a, chu mi pa chu Baaseia a ni a, chu mi pa chu Malkija a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />chu mi pa chu Ethnia a ni a, chu mi pa chu Zera a ni a, chu mi pa chu Adaia a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />chu mi pa chu Ethana a ni a, chu mi pa chu Zima a ni a, chu mi pa chu Simeia a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />chu mi pa chu Jahatha a ni a, chu mi pa chu Gersoma a ni a, chu mi pa chu Levia a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, vei lama che ṭhîn an unau, Meraria fapa chu Ethana a ni a, chu mi pa chu Kisia a ni a, chu mi pa chu Abdia a ni a, chu mi pa chu Maluka a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />chu mi pa chu Hasabia a ni a, chu mi pa chu Amazia a ni a, chu mi pa chu Hilkia a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />chu mi pa chu Amzia a ni a, chu mi pa chu Bania a ni a, chu mi pa chu Semera a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />chu mi pa chu Mahlia a ni a, chu mi pa chu Musia a ni a, chu mi pa chu Meraria a ni a, chu mi pa chu Levia a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, an unau Levi-hote chu Pathian biak bûka rawngbâwl hna zawng zawng thawk tûra ruat an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Arona leh a thlahte erawh chuan Pathian chhiahhlawh Mosian thu a lo pêk tawh zawng zawng ang khân, hmun thianghlim ber hna zawng zawng chu changin, Israel-te tâna remna siam nân hâlral thilhlanna maichâmah leh rimtui hlanna maichâmah an hlân ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tin, hêngte hi Arona thlahte chu an ni: Eleazara chu a fapa a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Phinehasa a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Abisua a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />chu mi fapa chu Bukia a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Uzia a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Zerahia a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />chu mi fapa chu Meraiotha a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Amaria a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Ahituba a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />chu mi fapa chu Zadoka a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Ahimaaza a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tin, hêngte hi an ram chhûnga an awm hmun khuar dân ang zêla an awm hmunte chu a ni: Arona fa, Kohath mi hnamte chu (ṭhum vâwr chu an chunga tlu hmasa ber a ni rêng a)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Judai rama Hebron leh a dai vêlte chu an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Khawpui dai vêlte leh a khawperte erawh chu Jephunea fapa Kaleba an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tin, Arona fapate chu inhumhimna khawpui Hebron te, Libna khua a dai vêlte nên, Jatir leh Estemoa khua a dai vêlte nên,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Hilen khua a dai vêlte nên, Debir khua a dai vêlte nên,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Asan khua a dai vêlte nên, Beth-semes khua a dai vêlte nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Benjamin hnamte zîng ata Geba khua a dai vêlte nên, Alemeth khua a dai vêlte nên, Anathoth khua a dai vêlte nên an pe a. An hnam zînga khawpui pêk zawng zawng chu khaw sâwm leh khaw thum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tin, Kohatha fapa dangte chu hnam zâtve, Manasea thlahte hnam zâtve chanpuala mite khawpui sâwm, ṭhum vâwrin an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tin, Gersoma fapate chu an hnam kal dân ang zêlin, Isakar hnam chanpuala mi te, Aser hnam chanpuala mi te, Naphtali hnam chanpuala mi te, Basan rama Manase hnam chanpuala mi te, khawpui sâwm leh pathum an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Meraria fapate chu an hnam kal dân ang zêlin Reuben hnam chanpuala mi te, Gad hnam chanpuala mi te, Zebulun hnam chanpuala mi te, ṭhum vâwrin khaw sâwm leh pahnih an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan Levi-ho chite chu khawpuite leh a dai vêlte an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tichuan, Juda hnam chanpuala mi te, Simeon hnam chanpuala mi te, Benjamin hnam chanpuala mi te khawpui hming sawi tâkte chu ṭhum vâwrin an pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Tin, Kohatha thlahte hnam ṭhenkhat chuan Ephraim-hote chanpuala mi khawpuite an chang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Tin, Ephraim tlâng rama inhumhimna khawpui Sekem chu a dai vêlte nên an pe a, Gezer a dai vêlte nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Jokmeam a dai vêlte nên, Beth-horon a dai vêlte nên,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Aijalon a dai vêlte nên, Gath-rimon a dai vêlte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Tin, Manase hnam zâtvete chanpuala mi chu - Kohatha thlahte hnam la awmte tân chuan - Aner a dai vêlte nên, Bileam a dai vêlte nên an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Manase hnam zâtvete chanpuala mi Gersoma fapate an pêk chu Basan rama Golan a dai vêlte nên, Astaroth a dai vêlte nên a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Isakar hnam chanpuala mi Kedes a dai vêlte nên, Daberath a dai vêlte nên,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Ramoth a dai vêlte nên, Anem a dai vêlte nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />Aser hnam chanpuala mi Masal a dai vêlte nên, Abdon a dai vêlte nên,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />Hukok a dai vêlte nên, Rehob a dai vêlte nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" />Naphtali hnam chanpuala mi Galili rama Kedes a dai vêlte nên, Hamon a dai vêlte nên, Kiriathaim a dai vêlte nên a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" />Tin, Meraria thlah Levi-ho dangte an pêk chu Zebulun hnam chanpuala mi Rimono khua a dai vêlte nên, Tabor khua a dai vêlte nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" />Jeriko zâwn Jordan râl, Jordan chhak lampangah Reuben hnam chanpuala mi thlalêra Bezer khua a dai vêlte nên, Jahzah khua a dai vêlte nên,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" />Kedemoth khua a dai vêlte nên, Mephaath khua a dai vêlte nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" />Gad hnam chanpuala mi Gilead rama Ramoth khua a dai vêlte nên, Mahanaim khua a dai vêlte nên,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="81" style="v" />Hesbon khua a dai vêlte nên, Jazer khua a dai vêlte nên a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isakara fapate chu Tola te, Pua te, Jasuba te, Simrona te an ni a, pali an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tola fapate chu Uzia te, Rephaia te, Jeriela te, Jamaia te, Ibsama te, Samuela te an ni a, Tola thlahtea chhûngkaw puipa an ni. Anmahni chhuana mi chak huaisen an ni a; Davida dam lai chuan sînghnih leh sânghnih leh zaruk an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Uzia fapa chu Izrahia a ni a; Izrahia fapate chu Mikaela te, Obadia te, Joela te, Isia te an ni. Panga an ni a, an vaiin puipa an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, an chhûngkaw chhiarnaa chhiar tel sipai sîngthum leh sângruk an awm bawk a; nupui leh fapa tam tak nei an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Isakar hnam zawng zawng chhiarnaa chhiar tel an unaute chu mi chak huaisen sîngriat leh sângsarih an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Benjamina fapate chu Bela te, Bekera te, Jediaela te an ni a, pathum an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bela fapate chu Ezbona te, Uzia te, Uziela te, Jerimotha te, Iria te an ni a, panga an ni. Chhûngkaw puipa, mi chak huaisen an ni a, thlahte chhiarnaa chhiarte chu sînghnih leh sânghnih leh sawmthum leh pali an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bekera fapate chu Zemira te, Joasa te, Eliezera te, Elioenaia te, Omria te, Jeremotha te, Abija te, Anathotha te, Alemetha te an ni. Chûng zawng zawng chu Bekera fapate an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, anni chu thlahte chhiarnaa ziak dân chuan chhûngkaw puipa, mi chak huaisen sînghnih leh zahnih an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jediaela fapa chu Bilhana a ni a; Bilhana fapate chu Jeusa te, Benjamina te, Ehuda te, Kenaana te, Zethana te, Tarsisa te, Ahisahara te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jediaela thlah zawng zawngte chu chhûngkaw puipa mi chak huaisen, sîngkhat leh sângsarih leh zahnih an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ira fapa Supima leh Hupima te, Ahera fapa Husima te nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Naphtalia fapate chu Jaziela te, Gunia te, Jezera te, Saluma te an ni a, Bilhaii fate an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Manasea fapate chu, a nupuiin Asriela a hring a (A hmeinu Aram miin Gileada pa Makira a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Makira chuan Hupim leh Supim mi nupuiah a nei a; tin, a farnu hming chu Maaki a ni), a dawttu hming chu Zelophehada a ni; tin, Zelophehada chuan fanute a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Makira nupui Maaki chuan fapa a hring a, a hmingah Peresa a sa a. A unaupa hming chu Seresa a ni a; a fapate chu Ulama leh Rakema an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ulama fapa chu Bedana a ni. Chûngte chu Manasea thlah Makira fapa Gileada fapate chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, a farnu Hamoleketin Isoda te, Abiezera te, Malaa te a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Semida fapate chu Ahiana te, Sekema te, Likhia te, Aniama te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ephraima fapa chu Suthela a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Bereda a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Tahatha a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Eleada a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Tahatha a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />chu mi fapa chu Zabada a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Suthela a ni a, Ezera leh Eleada, chumi rama chêng Gath khuaa mite ran rual zuk lâk an tum avânga an lo thah tâkte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An pa Ephraima chuan ni rei tak a sûn a; tin, a unaute chu amah hnêm tûrin an va kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, a nupui chu a pâwl a, a rai a, fapa a hring a, vânduainain an in chhûng a tlâkbuak avângin a hmingah chuan Beria a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, a fanu chu Seerai a ni a, chu mi chuan Beth-horon thlangta zâwk leh chhakta zâwk leh Uzen-seera a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A fapa chu Repha a ni a, Resepha nên, chu mi fapa chu Tela a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Tahana a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />chu mi fapa chu Ladana a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Amihuda a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Elisama a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />chu mi fapa chu Nuna a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Josua a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, an chanpual leh an chênnate chu Bethel leh a khawperte, chhak lamah Naaran, thlang lamah Gezer a khawperte nên, Sekem pawh a khawperte nên, Aza a khawperte thlengin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />tin, Manasea thlahte ramri lamah chuan Beth-san leh a khawper te, Taanak leh a khawper te, Megido leh a khawper te, Dor leh a khawperte nên a ni. Chûngah chuan Israela fa Josefa thlahte chu an awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Asera fate chu Imna te, Isva te, Isvia te, Beria te, an farnu Seri te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Beria fapate chu Hebera leh Birzaitha pa Malkiela an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Hebera chuan Japhleta te, Somera te, Hothama te, an farnu Suai te a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Japhleta fapate chu Pasaka te, Bimhala te, Asvatha te an ni. Chûngte chu Japhleta thlahte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Semera fapate chu Ahia te, Roga te, Jehuba te, Arama te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, a unaupa Helema fapate chu Zopha te, Imna te, Selesa te, Amala te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Zopha fapate chu Suaha te, Harnephera te, Shuala te, Beria te, Imra te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Bezera te, Hoda te, Samma te, Silsa te, Ithrana te, Beera te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jethera fapate chu Jephunea te, Pispa te, Ara te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, Ula fapate chu Ara te, Haniela te, Rizia te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chûng zawng zawngte chu Asera thlah, chhûngkaw puipa, mi chak huaisen, hotu berte chu an ni. Tichuan, thlahte chhiarnaah râlkaia chhiarte chu sînghnih leh sângruk an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Benjaminan a fa tîrah Bela a hring a, a dawtah Asbela, a dawt lehah Ahara,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a dawt lehah Noha, a dawt leh pekah Rapha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bela fapate chu Adara te, Gera te, Abihuda te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abisua te, Naamana te, Ahova te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gera te, Sephuphana te, Hurama te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ehuda fapate chu hêngte hi an ni; hêngte hi Geba-a chêngho chhûngkaw puipate an ni a, Manahath-ah salah an hruai a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />chûngte chu Naamana te, Ahija te, Gera te an ni a, salah a hruai a, ani chuan Uza leh Ahihuda a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Saharaima chuan a nupuite a kaltîr hnuin Moab ramah fate a hring a; a nupuite chu Husimi leh Baari an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a nupui Hodesi lakah Jobaba te, Zibia te, Mesa te, Malkama te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jeuza te, Sakia te, Mirma te a nei a. Chûngte chu a fapa, chhûngkaw puipate chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Husimi lakah Abituba leh Elpaala a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Elpaala fapate chu Ebera te, Misama te, Semeda te (chu mi chuan Ono leh Lod khua leh a khawperte a siam a);
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gath-a awmho hnawt chhuaktu, Aijalon-a awmho chhûngkaw puipa, Beria leh Sema te nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahiova te, Sasaka te, Jeremotha te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zebadia te, Arada te, Edera te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Beria fapa - Mikaela te, Ispa te, Joha te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Elpaala fapate: Zebadia, Mesullama, Hizkia, Hebera,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ismeraia te, Izlia leh Jobaba te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Simeia fapate: Jakima, Zikria, Zabdia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Elienaia , Zillethaia, Eliela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Adaia, Beraia leh Simratha te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sasaka fapate: Ispana, Ebera, Eliela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Abdona, Zikria, Hanana,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hanania, Elama, Anthothija,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Iphdeia leh Penuela te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jerohama fapate: Samseraia, Seharia, Athalia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jaaresia, Elija leh Zikria te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chûngte chu anmahni chhuanah chuan chhûngkaw puipa, hotute an ni. Chûngte chu Jerusalem-ah an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Gibeon-ah chuan Gibeona pa Jeiela a awm a, a nupuia hming chu Maaki a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tin, a fapa upa ber chu Abdona a ni a, a fa dangte chu Zura te, Kisa te, Baala te, Nadaba te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Gedora te, Ahiova te, Zekera te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Miklothan Simea a hring a. Tin, anni pawh chu Jerusalem-ah an unaute zîngah, an unaute depah an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Neran Kisa a hring a, Kisan Saula a hring a, Saulan Jonathana te, Malkisua te, Abinadaba te, Esbaala te a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jonathana fapa chu Merib-baala a ni a; tin, Merib-baalan Mika a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mika fapate chu Pithona te, Meleka te, Tarea te, Ahaza te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, Ahazan Jehoada a hring a, Jehoadan Alemetha leh Azmavetha leh Zimria a hring a; tin, Zimrian Moza a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mozan Binea a hring a, chu mi fapa chu Rapha a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Eleasa a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Azela a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Azela chuan fapa paruk a nei a, an hming chu hêngte hi a ni: Azrikama te, Bokerua te, Ismaela te, Searia te, Obadia te, Hanana te. Chûng zawng zawngte chu Azela fapate an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, a unaupa Eseka fapate chu a fa tîr Ulama a ni a, a dawttu chu Jeusa a ni a, a dawt lehtu chu Elipheleta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ulama fapate chu mi chak huaisen, thal kâp mi an ni a, fapa te, tupa te tam tak an nei a, za leh sawmnga an ni. Chûng zawng zawng chu Benjamina thlahte an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel zawng zawng chu thlahte chhiarnaa chhiar an ni a; tichuan, ngai teh, Israel lalte lehkhabuah a chuang a ni. Juda-te erawh chu an bawhchhiatna avângin Babulon-ah sala hruaiin an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, an chanpual khua luah ṭantute chu Israel-ho te, puithiamho te, Levi-ho te, Nethin-ho te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem-ah chuan Juda thlahte, Benjamina thlahte, Ephraima leh Manasea thlahte an awm a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Uthaia chu Amihuda fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Omria fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Imria fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Bania fapa a ni a, chûngte chu Juda fapa Pereza thlahte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Silon-ho thlahte chu: Asaia chu an zînga upa ber a ni a, a fate nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zera thlahte chu: Jeuela, a unaute nên, zaruk leh sawmkua an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Benjamina thlahte chu: Salua chu Mesulama fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Hodavia fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Hasenua fapa a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ibneia chu Jerohama fapa a ni a; Ela chu Uzia fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Mikria fapa a ni a; Mesulama chu Sephatia fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Reuela fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Ibnija fapa a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tin, anmahniho chhuanah chuan unau zakua leh sawmnga leh paruk an ni. Chûng zawng zawngte chu an hnam zînga an chhûngkaw puipate an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puithiamte chu: Jedaia te, Jehoiariba te, Jakina te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hilkia fapa Azaria te an ni a; chu mi chu Mesulama fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Zadoka fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Meraiotha fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Pathian ina hotu Ahituba fapa a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jerohama fapa Adaia te nên, chu mi chu Pasura fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Malkija fapa a ni a, Adiela fapa Maasaia te nên, chu mi chu Jazera fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Mesulama fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Mesilemitha fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Imera fapa a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />an unaute chu chhûngkaw puipa, sângkhat leh zasarih leh sawmruk an ni a. Pathian ina rawngbâwl hna thawk mi tak an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Levi-hote chu: Hasuba fapa Semaia a ni a, chu mi chu Azrikama fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Hasabia fapa a ni a, chûngte chu Meraria fapate an ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bakbakara te, Heresa te, Galala te, Matania te an ni a, chu mi chu Mika fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Zikria fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Asapha fapa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Semaia fapa Obadia, chu mi chu Galala fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Jeduthuna fapa a ni; tin, Asa fapa Berekia, chu mi chu Netophath-ho khuaa mi Elkana fapa a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, kawngkhâr vêngtute chu Saluma te, Akuba te, Talmona te, Ahimana te, an unaute nên an ni. Saluma chu hotu ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ani chu tûn hmain lal kulh kawngka chhakta vêngtu a ni ṭhîn a; anni chu Levia thlahte riahhmun kawngkhâr vêngtu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Korea fapa chu Saluma a ni a, chu mi chu Ebiasapha fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Kora fapa a ni a, chûngte chu an unau an chhûngte Kora-hote nên rawngbâwltu, biak bûk kawngkhârte vêngtu an ni a. An pute chu Lalpa biak bûk rawngbâwltu, a luhnate vêngtu an ni ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tûn hma chuan Eleazara fapa Phinehasa chu an hotu a ni a; Lalpa chu a hnênah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Meselemia fapa Zekaria chu inbiakna puan in kawngkhâr vêngtu a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chûng kawngkhâr vêngtu atâna thlan zawng zawngte chu zahnih leh sâwm leh pahnih an ni. Davida leh zâwlnei Samuelan an thawh tûr an lo ruatte chu mahni khua ṭheuhva thlahte chhiarnaa ziak an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, anmahni leh an fate chuan Lalpa in kawngkhâr, biak bûk in kawngkhârte chu enkawlin, vêngtu chan an chang ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A kil pali - chhak lampangah te, thlang lampangah te, hmâr lampangah te, chhim lampangah te chuan - kawngkhâr vêngtute an awm ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, khuaa mi an unaute chu, ni sarih apiangin hunbi nei têin an hnêna awm tûrin an kal ve ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kawngkhâr vêngtu hotu palite chu Levi hnamte an ni a, Pathian ina sum dahna leh pindan enkawltu an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, enkawlna chu an hna a nih avâng leh, tûk tina kawng hawn chu an hna a nih avângin Pathian in vêlahte chuan an riak ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ṭhenkhat chuan rawngbâwlna bungbêl an enkawl a, an dah luh dâwn leh an lâk chhuah dâwnin an chhiar zêl ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ṭhenkhat chu bungrua te, hmun thianghlima bungbêl zawng zawng te, chhangphut dip tak te, uain te, hriak te, beraw leh rimtui te enkawl tûra ruat an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, puithiam fapa ṭhenkhat chuan rimtui an siam ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kora hnam, Saluma fapa upa ber, Levi mi Matithia chu bêla thil kan lam ngaihtuahtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Kohath-ho thlahte zînga mi an unau ṭhenkhat chu chhangdah, Chawlhni apianga buatsaiha chhang dahtute an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chûngte chu hla satuho, Levi-ho chhûngkaw puipa, biak in pindan nghâktu, rawngbâwlna danga âwlte an ni a; chhûn leh zâna thawk reng an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chûngte chu anmahni chhuan zawng zawnga hotu, Levi-ho chhûngkaw puipate an ni a, Jerusalem-a awm an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Gibeon-ah chuan Gibeon-ho thlahtu Jeiela a awm a (a nupuia hming chu Maaki a ni),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />a fa tîr chu Abdona a ni a, a dangte chu Zura te, Kisa te, Baala te, Nera te, Nadaba te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Gedora te, Ahiova te, Zekaria te, Miklotha te an ni leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, Miklothan Simeama a hring a. Anniho pawh chu Jerusalem-ah an unau zain an unaute depah an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Neran Kisa a hring a, Kisan Saula a hring a, Saulan Jonathana te, Malkisua te, Abinadaba te, Esbaala te a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jonathana fapa chu Merib-baala a ni a, Merib-baala chuan Mika a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mika fapate chu Pithona te, Meleka te, Tahrea te, Ahaza te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, Ahazan Jara a hring a; Jaran Alemetha te, Azmavetha te, Zimria te a hring a; tin, Zimrian Moza a hring a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Mozan Binea a hring a, chu mi fapa chu Rephaia a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Eleasa a ni a, chu mi fapa chu Azela a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Azela chuan fapa paruk a nei a, an hmingte chu Azrikama te, Bokerua te, Ismaela te, Searia te, Obadia te, Hanana te an ni; chûngte chu Azela fapate an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Philistia mite chuan Israel-hote chu an bei a; tin, Israel mite chu Philistia mite hmaah chuan an tlânchhia a, Gilboa tlângah chuan thahin an awm ta zul mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Philistia mite chuan Saula leh a fapate chu an ûm ta ngat ngat a; tin, Philistia mite chuan Saula fapa Jonathana te, Abinadaba te, Malkisua te chu an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Saula chu a chau ta êm êm mai a, thal kâp mite chuan an ûm pha a, an hliam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chuan a râlthuam kengtu hnênah chuan, “I khandaih kha phawi la, mi han chhun tlang rawh; hêng serh tan lohte hian mi uankhum dah ang e,” a ti a. Nimahsela, a râlthuam kengtu chuan a ti duh lo va; a hlau êm êm si a. Chutichuan, Saula chuan a khandaih chu a la a, a bawh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, a râlthuam kengtu chuan Saula a thi tih a hriat chuan, ani pawh chuan a khandaih chu a bawh ve a, a thi ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula leh a fapate pathum chu an thi ta a, an pafa za chuan an thi ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, ruama awm Israel mi zawng zawngte chuan an tlânchhia tih leh, Saula leh a fapate chu an thi ta tih an hriat chuan, an khuate chu an chhuahsan a, an tlân bo ta a; tin, Philistia mite chuan an va luah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a tûkah chuan Philistia-hoten an râl thahte thuam hlihsak tûra an va kal chuan Gilboa tlânga Saula leh a fapate lo thi chu an va hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, a thuam an hlîp a, a lû leh a râlthuam chu an la a, an pathian lemte leh mite hnêna chanchin puan tûrin Philistia ramah chuan an thawn vêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, a râlthuam chu an pathiante inah an dah a, a lû chu Dagona inah an târ a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Jabes-gilead mi zawng zawngten Philistia mitena Saula an tih dân zawng zawng thu an lo hriat chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />mi huaisenho zawng zawngte chu an thawk chhuak a, Saula ruang leh a fapate ruang chu an la a, Jabes khuaah an kalpui a, a ruhte chu Jabes khuaa sasaw hnuaiah an phûm a, ni sarih chaw an nghei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, Saula chu Lalpa thu pawm duh lova, Lalpa chunga a bawhchhiat avâng leh, Lalpa chu râwn lova ramhuaizâwl aienthiam aientîra a râwn avângin a thi a ni. Chuvâng chuan a ni, a tihhluma, ram pawh chu Jesaia fapa Davida chu a pêk tâk ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel-ho zawng zawng chu Hebron-a Davida hnênah an kal khâwm a, “Ngai teh, i thisen zawmpui kan ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tûn hmaa Saula a lal lai khân Israel-te hruai chhuak leh hruai lûttu i ni ṭhîn a; tin, Lalpa i Pathianin i hnênah, ‘Ka mi Israel-te chu i châwm ang a, ka mi Israel-te chungah hotuah i awm ang,’ a ti chia,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel-ho upa zawng zawng chu Hebron-ah lal hnênah chuan an kal a; tin, Davidan Hebron-ah chuan Lalpa hmaah an hnênah thu a thlung a. Tin, Lalpan Samuela hmanga a sawi ang khân Davida chu Israel-te lal atân hriak an thih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Davida leh Israel-ho zawng zawng chu Jerusalem-ah an kal a (chu chu Jebus a ni); tin, chutah chuan chumi rama mi, Jebus-hote chu an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Jebus-a awmhote chuan Davida hnênah, “Hetah hian i lo lût tawp lo vang,” an ti a. Nimahsela, Davida chuan Zion kulh chu a la ta rêng rêng a; chu chu Davida khua tih a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Davidan, “Tu pawh Jebus-ho han bei hmasa apiang chu sipai hotu berah a awm ang,” a ti a. Tichuan, Zeruii fapa Joaba chu a han chho hmasa a, hotu berah an siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Davida chu kulhah chuan a awm ta a; chuvângin, Davida khawpui an ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Milo aṭangin khawpui vêl kulh chu a siam ṭha a; tin, Joaban khawpui chhûng a siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida chu a lo ropui ta deuh deuh va; Sipaihote Lalpa chu a hnênah a awm avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hêngte hi Davida sipai hmingthang, Israel zawng zawngte nêna ṭanga, Israel-te chungchâng thûa Lalpan a sawi anga lala siam tûra a ram dinpuitu huaisen tak takte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hêngte hi sipai huaisen, Davida hnêna awmte an ni: Hakmon mi fapa Jasobeama, sawmthum pâwl hotu, zathum chungah a fei leka ṭum khata thattu chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, a dawttu chu Aho mi Dodova fapa Eleazara, sipai huaisen pathumte zinga pakhat kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ani chu barli awm chûkna, Philistia mite indo tûra an infâwk khâwmna hmun Pas-dammim-ah khân Davida hnênah a awm a; tin, mipuite chu Philistia mite hmaah chuan an tlânchhe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, anni chu chumi hmunah chuan an ding a, an lo ṭang tlat a, Philistia mite chu an that a; tichuan, Lalpan ropui taka ngamsakin a chhandam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, sipai sawmthum zînga huaisen pathumte chu lungpuiah Adulam pûkah Davida hnênah an chhuk a; Philistia sipaiho chuan Rephaim ruamah ṭanhmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan Davida chu kulhbîngah a awm a; tin, Philistia sipaiho chu Bethlehem-ah an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan, “Bethlehem-a tuichhunchhuah tui, kulh kawngkhâr kianga mi kha in tûra mi pe han awm teh sela aw!” a ti a, a tui a hâl êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, pathumte chuan Philistia sipaiho chu an tâwn tlang a, kulh kawngkhâr kianga mi Bethlehem-a tuichhunchhuah tui chu an va chawi a, Davida hnênah an rawn la a; nimahsela, Davida chuan a lo in duh lo va, Lalpa tân a bun chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Hei hi ka in loh tûrzia mai chu! Hêng thih huama inpehote thisen chu ka in dâwn em ni? Thih huama inpein an rawn la a ni si a,” a ti a. Chutichuan, a in duh ta lo va. Mi huaisen pathumte chuan chutiang chuan an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Joaba unau Abisaia chu pathumte zînga hotu ber a ni a; mi zathumte chungah a fei a lek a, anmahni chu a thah avângin pathumte zîngah chuan hmingṭhat a hlawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathumte zîngah chuan pahnihte ai chuan amah chu chawimawi tlâk a ni a, an hotuah an siam a, pathum hmasate zîngah erawh chuan a tel lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Kabzeel mi huai, thil nasa tak titu Jehoiada fapa Benaia chuan Moab mi Ariela fapate pahnih chu a that a; tin a zuk chhuk a, vûr tlâk hun laiin khuarkhurumah sakeibaknei a zuk that bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta mi, mi âwmkhauh pui, tawng ngaa sâng a that a; chu Aigupta mi chuan fei lian pui, puan tahtu themkawl ang hi a keng a. Tin, ani chuan tiang nên chuan a zuk pan a, Aigupta mi fei chu a pawh thlâksak a, ama feiin a chhun hlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jehoiada fapa Benaia chuan chutiang chuan a ti a, sipai huaisen pathumte zînga hmingṭhat a hlawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ngai teh u, mi sawmthumte ai chuan chawimawi tlâk a ni a, pathum hmasate zîngah erawh chuan a tel lo; tin, Davida chuan a vêngtu pâwl hotuah a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sipaite zînga mi huaisen dangte chu hêngte hi an ni: Joaba unau Asahela te, Bethlehem khuaa mi Dodova fapa Elhanana te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Haror mi Samotha te, Pelon mi Heleza te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Teko mi Ikesa fapa Ira te, Anathoth mi Abiezera te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Husath mi Sibekaia te, Aho mi Ilaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Netophath mi Maharaia te, Netophath mi Baana fapa Heleda te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Benjamina thlah Gibea khuaa mi Ribaia fapa Ithaia te, Pirathon mi Benaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Gaas luitêa mi Huraia te, Arbath mi Abiela te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Baharum mi Azmavetha te, Saalbon mi Eliaba te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Gizon mi Hasema fapate, Harar mi Sagea fapa Jonathana te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Harar mi Sakara fapa Ahiama te, Ura fapa Eliphala te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mekerath mi Hephera te, Pelon mi Ahija te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Karmel mi Hezroa te, Ezbaia fapa Naaraia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nathana unaupa Joela te, Hagria fapa Mibhara te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Amon mi Zeleka te, Zeruii fapa Joaba râlthuam kengtu Beeroth mi Naharaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ithra mi Ira te, Ithra mi Gareba te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hit mi Uria te, Ahlaia fapa Zabada te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Reuben mi Siza fapa Adina, Reuben mite zînga hotu, a hnêna mi sawmthumte nên,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Maaka fapa Hanana te, Mithna mi Josaphata te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Asterath mi Uzia te, Aroer mi Hothama fapa Sama leh Jeiela te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Simria fapa Jediaela te, a unaupa Tiz mi Joha te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Mahav mi Eliela te, Elnaama fapate Jeribaia leh Josavia te, Moab mi Ithma te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mezoba mi Eliela te, Obeda te, Jaasiela te pawh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Kisa fapa Saula avânga Davida chu Ziglag-a a inkhung tlat laia a hnêna lo kalte chu hêngte hi an ni; anni chu indonaa amah puitu mi huaisente zînga mi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thal ngul keng mi, ding lam leh vei lama virvawma lung vawm leh thal ngula thal kah thiam an ni a; Benjamin mi Saula chite an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A puipa ber chu Ahiezera a ni a; tin, Gibeath mi Semaa fapa Joasa; tin, Azmavetha fapa Jeziela leh Peletha te; Beraka te, Anathoth mi Jehua te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />sawmthum zînga mi huaisen, sawmthum hotu Gibeon mi Ismaia te; Jeremia te, Jahaziela te, Johanana te, Gederat mi Jozabada te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Eluzaia te, Jerimotha te, Bealia te, Semaria te, Harup mi Sephatia te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kora mi Elkana te, Isia te, Azarela te, Joezera te, Jasobeama te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gedor mi Jerohama fapa Joela leh Zebadia te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Gad mite zînga mi, mi chak huaisen, indo thiam, phaw leh fei hman thiam ṭhenkhat chu thlalêra kulhah Davida hnênah khân an pakai a; an hmêlte chu sakeibaknei hmêl ang a ni a, tlânga sakhilâ anga zuanzâng an ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a pakhatna chu Ezera a ni a, a dawttu chu Obadia, a dawt lehtu chu Eliaba,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a dawt lehtu chu Mismana, a dawt lehtu chu Jeremia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a dawt lehtu chu Ataia, a dawt lehtu chu Eliela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a dawt lehtu chu Johanana, a dawt lehtu chu Elzabada,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a dawt lehtu chu Jeremia, a dawt lehtu chu Makbanaia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chûng Gad mite chu sipai hotute an ni; an zînga chak lo ber pawh chu za hen a ni a, a chak ber chu sângkhat hen a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chûngho chu an ni, thla khatnaa Jordan lui a kuang zawng zawng a liam laia va kal kaia, ruama chêngho zawng zawng chhak lam leh thlang lama tlânchhiattîrtute kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Benjamin-ho leh Juda-ho zînga mi ṭhenkhat chu kulhah Davida hnênah an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida chu anmahni hmuak tûrin a kal a, “Ṭha lam thûa mi pui tûra ka hnêna lo kal in nih chuan, ka thinlungin a zawm tlat ang che u a; amaherawhchu, ka kutin pawi a khawih lo tih hre reng chung sia ka hmêlmate mi mantîr tuma lo kal in nih chuan, kan pi leh pute Pathian chuan chhinchhiahin, zilhhau che u rawh se,” a va ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, sawmthum chunga hotu Amasaia chungah chuan thlarau a lo thleng a, “David, i mite kan ni e; Jesaia fapa, i lama ṭang kan ni e! I chungah thlamuanna awm rawh se, nangmah puitute chungah pawh thlamuanna awm rawh se! I Pathian chuan a ṭanpui ṭhîn si chia,” a ti a. Tichuan, Davida chuan anmahni chu a la a, sipai pâwl hotuahte a siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Philistia-hoten Saula do tûra an thawh lai khân Davida pawh a tel ve a, Manase-ho zînga ṭhenkhat pawh Davida lamah an pakai a; amaherawhchu, Philistia hotute a pui ta chuang lo; “A pu Saula lamah a pakai ang a, kan lû kan hloh dah ang e,” tiin an inrâwn a, an hnar kîr leh ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Ziglag khua a thlen chuan Manase-ho zînga sipai sâng hotu - Adna te, Jozabada te, Jediaela te, Mikaela te, Jozabada te, Elihua te, Zilethaia te chu a lamah an pakai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Davidan rawlrâl pâwlho a bei chu an beihpui ve a; an vai chuan mi chak huaisen, sipai hotu an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ni tin Davida lama ṭang tûrin an kal an kal a, Pathian sipaiho ang maia sipai pâwl ropui tak an lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa thu anga Saula ram Davida luahtîr tûra Hebron khuaa Davida hnêna indona râlthuama inthuam kal zât chu hetiang a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Juda thlah, indona râlthuama inthuam, phaw leh fei keng mi chu sângruk leh zariat an ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Simeona thlah, indonaa mi chak huaisen chu sângsarih leh za;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Levia thlah sângli leh zaruk;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jehoiada chu Arona thlah hruaitu a ni a, a hnênah sângthum leh zasarih an tel ve a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zadoka, tlangvâl chak huaisen, a chhûngkaw zînga mi, sipai hotu sawmhnih leh pahnih nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Benjamina thlahte zinga mi, Saula chite sângthum, tûn hma chuan a tam zâwkte chu Saula ho lama ṭang an ni ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ephraima thlahte zînga mi, mi chak huaisen, an chhûngkaw zînga mi hmingthang sînghnih leh zariat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Manase hnam zâtvete zînga mi, Davida lala siam tûra thlan chhuah lo kalte sîngkhat leh sângriat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Isakara thlahte zînga mi, chûng lai hun thil chinchâng hre mi, Israel-tena an thiltih tûr ṭûl hre mi, hotu deuh deuh zahnih, an unaute zawng zawng chu an thu hnuaia awm an ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Zebulun-ho zînga mi, râl bei tlâk ṭhiau, indona hmanraw tinrêng nêna ṭan khawh thiam, Davida tân rilru nghet tak pu mi sîngnga an ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Naphtali-ho zînga mi, sipai hotu sangkhat leh fei keng mi sîngthum leh sângsarih nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Dan-ho zinga mi, râlthuama inthuam sa sînghnih leh sângriat leh zaruk;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Aser-ho zînga mi, râl bei tlâk ṭhiau ṭan khawh thiam sîngli;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jordan râla Reuben-ho zînga mi te, Gad-ho zînga mi te, Manase hnam zâtve zînga mite, indona hmanrua tinrêngte nêna thawk nuai khat leh sînghnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chûng zawng zawng chu indo mi, ṭan khawh thiam mi an ni a, Davida chu Israel-ho zawng zawng chunga lala siam tûrin rilru hmun khat puin Hebron-ah an kal a; tin, Israel dang zawng zawngte pawhin Davida chu lala siam tûrin rilru hmun khat an pu ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, Davida hnênah chuan ni thum ei leh bârin an awm a; an unauten an buatsaihsak vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chu chang pawh ni lovin, an laichîn unau, Isakar ram aṭang te, Zebulun ram aṭang te, Naphtali ram aṭang te lamin sabengtung te, sanghâwngsei te, sakawr te, sebâwngpatein ei tûr lam - chhang te, theipui hlâwm te, grêp rah pho ro bâwr te, uain te, hriak te an phurhtîr a, bâwngpa te, berâm te tam tak an rawn keng bawk a; Israel ram chu lâwmnain a khat a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan hotu zawng zawng, sâng hotute leh za hotute chu a râwn hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Davidan Israel pung khâwmho zawng zawng hnênah chuan, “Ṭha in tih zâwng a niha, Lalpa kan Pathian remtih zâwng a nih bawk chuan, Israel ram zawng zawnga kan unau la awmte chu, dai vêl nei khuaa awm puithiamte leh Levi-hote nên kan hnêna rawn inkhâwm ve tûr hian i sâwm vêl ang u hmiang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tin, kan Pathian bâwm hi i la leh teh ang u, Saula lal lai khân kan ngaihven hauh lo mai a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, pung khâwmho zawng zawng chuan chutianga tih chu an duh a, mi zawng zawng ngaiha thil dik a ni rêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davidan Aigupta lui Sihor aṭanga Hamath khaw luhna thlenga Israel mi zawng zawngte chu Kiriath-jearim khuaa Pathian bâwm chu la tûrin a khâwm vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida leh Israel mi zawng zawng chu Judai rama Baalakhua, Kiriath-jearim an tihah chuan, cherub-ho chunga ṭhu Lalpa hming chuanna thuthlung bâwm chu la tûrin an han chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Pathian bâwm chu Abinadaba in ata tawlailîr tharin an kalpui a, Uza leh Ahiovan tawlailîr chu an khalh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Davida leh Israel mi zawng zawngte chuan hla sain, ṭingṭang te, perhkhuang te, khuangtê te, dârbenthek te, tawtawrâwt te nên, Pathian hmaah an lâm bûng bûng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Kidona hruih an han thlen chuan, Uza chuan bâwm chu chelh tumin a han ban a, bâwngte chu an pai an pai avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thin chu Uza chungah a thawk ta thut mai a, bâwm a chelh avâng chuan a tihlum ta a; chutah chuan Pathian hmaah a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Uza chunga kut a thlâk avângin Davida chu a thinur a; chumi hmun chu Perez-uza a vuah a; tûn thleng hian a la ni ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan chumi ni chuan Pathian chu a hlau va, “Engtin nge Pathian bâwm chu ka hawn theih tâk ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan bâwm chu Davida khuaah ama hnênah chuan a suan ta lo va, Git mi Obed-edoma inah a dah ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Pathian bâwm chu Git mi Obed-edoma inah, a chhûngte hnênah chuan thla thum a awm a; tichuan, Obed-edoma chhûngte leh a neih zawng zawng chu Lalpan mal a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Tura lal Hiraman Davida hnênah mi a tîr a, sidar thingte a thawn a, lung chhertute, themthiamte a in sa tûrin a tîr bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Lalpan Israel mite chunga lalah amah chu a tinghetin, a mi Israel-te avângin a ram chu a chawimawi a ni tih a hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Jerusalem-ah nupuite a neih belhchhah leh a, fanu leh fapate a nei leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem-a a fa neihte chu hêngte hi an ni: Samua te, Sobaba te, Nathana te, Solomona te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ibhara te, Elisua te, Elpeleta te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Noga te, Nephega te, Japhia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Elisama te, Beeliada te, Elipheleta te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Philistia miten Davida chu Israel mi zawng zawngte lal atân hriak an thih tih an hriatin, Philistia mi zawng zawng chu Davida zawng tûrin an chho ta a; tin, Davida chuan a lo hria a, anmahni bei tûrin a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Philistia mite chu Rephaim ruamah an inzâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan, “Philistia mite bei tûrin ka han chho dâwn em? Ka kutah hian anniho chu i pe dâwn em?” tiin Lalpa a râwn a. Tin, Lalpa chuan Davida hnênah, “Han chho rawh; anniho chu i kutah ka pe dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, Baal-perazim-ah an chho va, chutah chuan Davidan anniho chu a hneh a, “ Lalpan ka hmêlmate chu ka kut hmangin tuikhuah sah ang maiin min tihdarhsak ta,” a ti a. Chutichuan, chumi hmun hmingah chuan Baal-perazim an vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, chutah chuan an milemte an kalsan a, Davidan thu a pe a, an hâl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Philistia-hote chu ruamah an inzâr leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Davidan Pathian a râwn leh a; tin, Pathianin a hnênah, “Um lovin kiansan la, thingtheihmu kûng zâwn lamah han bei zâwk rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, thingtheihmu lêra kal thâwm ang ri ṭhup ṭhup i hriat chuan che rawh, Philistia sipaite bei tûrin i hmaah Pathian a chhuak ta tihna a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Pathianin thu a pêk angin Davida chuan a ti a; Philistia sipaite chu Gibeon aṭanga Gezer thlengin an bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, ram tinah Davida hming chu a lo thang ta a; Lalpan hnam tin amah a ṭihtîr ta a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Davida khawpuiah chuan inte a sa a; tin, Pathian bâwm awmna hmun a buatsaih a, puan in a zârsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, Davidan, “Pathian bâwm hi Levi-hote chauh lo chuan tu mân an zâwn tûr a ni lo ve; Pathian bâwm hi kumkhuaa zâwntu leh a rawngbâwltu atâna Lalpa thlan an ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Davidan Lalpa bâwm a dahna tûr hmun a buatsaihnaa zâwn chho tûrin Jerusalem-ah Israel-ho zawng zawng chu a khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Davidan Arona fate leh Levi-ho a khâwm a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kohatha thlahte zînga mi, puipa ber Uriela, a unaute nên za leh sawmhnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Meraria thlahte zînga mi, puipa ber Asaia, a unaute nên zahnih leh sawmhnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gersoma thlahte zînga mi, puipa ber Joela, a unaute nên za leh sawmthum;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Elizaphana thlahte zînga mi, puipa ber Semaia, a unaute nên zahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hebrona thlahte zînga mi, puipa ber Eliela, a unaute nên sawmriat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Uziela thlahte zînga mi, puipa ber Aminadaba, a unaute nên za leh sâwm leh pahnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Davidan puithiam Zadoka leh Abiathara leh Levi-ho Uriela te, Asaia te, Joela te, Semaia te, Eliela te, Aminadaba te a ko va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />an hnênah, “Nangni hi Levi-ho puipa berte in ni a; Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa bâwm chu a hmun ka buatsaiha in zâwn chhoh theih nân nangni hi in unaute nên intithianghlim rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A tîrah pawh khân nangnin in zâwn loh avângin Lalpa kan Pathian chu kan chungah a ṭuan a nih kha, thupêk angin kan lo ti si lo va,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa bâwm chu zâwn chho tûr chuan puithiamte leh Levi-hote chu an intithianghlim a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thupêk Mosian a sawi ang khân, Levia thlahte chuan bâwm chu a zâwnfung chuan an zâwn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Davidan Levi-ho puipate chu an unaute zînga mi hla sa mite, thil tum rîk mi perhkhuang te, ṭingṭang te, dârbenthekte nêna ring tak leh hlim taka hla sa tûrin a ruattîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, Levi-ho chuan Joela fapa Hemana te, a unaute zînga mi Berekia fapa Asapha te, an unau Meraria fapate zînga mi Kusaia fapa Ethana te an ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, an unaute zînga mi Zekaria te, Bena te, Jaaziela te, Semiramotha te, Jehiela te, Unia te, Eliaba te, Benaia te, Maaseia te, Matithia te, Eliphelehua te, Mikneia te, kawngkhâr vêngtu Obed-edoma leh Jeiela te nên an ruat bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, hla satuho Hemana te, Asapha te, Ethana te chu dârbenthek ring taka bêng tûra ruat an ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tin, Zekaria te, Aziela te, Semiramotha te, Jehiela te, Unia te, Eliaba te, Maaseia te, Benaia te chu perhkhuangte nêna Alamoth sa tûra ruat an ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tin, Matithia te, Eliphelehua te, Mikneia te, Obed-edoma te, Jeiela te, Azazia te chu ṭingṭangte nêna Sheminith saa hmahruai tûra ruat an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Levi-ho puipa Kenania chu hla sa hotu a ni a, a thiam avângin hla hruaitu ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Berekia leh Elkana chu bâwm vêng vêltu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, puithiamho Sebania te, Josaphata te, Nethanela te, Amasaia te, Zekaria te, Benaia te, Eliezera ten Pathian bâwm hmaah chuan tawtawrâwt an tum a; tin, Obed-edoma leh Jehia chu bâwm vêng vêltu an ni bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida leh Israel upaho leh sipai sâng hotute chu, Obed-edoma ina mi Lalpa thuthlunna bâwm chu zuk la chho tûrin hlim takin an kal ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tin, heti hi a ni a, Lalpa thuthlunna bâwm zâwntu Levi-hote chu Pathianin a ṭanpui a, sebâwngpa pasarih leh berâmpa pasarihin an inthawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Davida leh bâwm zâwntu Levi-ho zawng zawng leh, hla satute leh hla sa hotu Kenania te chu puan zai sînin an inthuam a, Davida chuan puan zai sîn, puithiam kawr a ha bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel mi zawng zawng chuan au dur dur chung leh, tawtawrâwt bi nei leh tawtawrâwt hâm ruai ruai leh, dârbenthek te, perhkhuang te, ṭingṭangte nêna ri bûng bûngin Lalpa thuthlunna bâwm chu an la chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Lalpa thuthlunna bâwm Davida khuaa a luh lai chuan, Saula fanu Mikali chuan tukverh aṭangin a lo thlîr a, Lal Davida lâma zuang chu a hmu a, a hmusit rilru ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Pathian bâwm chu an la lût a, a dahna tûra Davidan a zâr, puan in chhûngah chuan an dah ta a; tin, Pathian hmaah chuan hâlral thilhlante leh remna thilhlante an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Davidan hâlral thilhlan leh remna thilhlante a hlan zawh chuan, Lalpa hmingin mipuite chu mal a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Israel mi zawng zawngte chu a hmei a pain chhang hlâwm khat leh sa hrang khat leh grêp rah pho ro bâwr khat a pe ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa bâwm hmaa rawngbâwl tûr leh Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chu hre renga amah fak tûr leh a hnêna lâwmthu sawi tûr Levi-ho ṭhenkhat a ruat a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a hotu berah chuan Asapha, a dawtah perhkhuang leh ṭingṭang tum mi Zekaria te, Jeiela te, Semiramotha te, Jehiela te, Matithia te, Eliaba te, Benaia te, Obed-edoma te: Jeielan ṭingṭang a tum a, Asapha chuan dârbenthek a bêng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tin, puithiam Benaia leh Jahaziela chuan Pathian thuthlunna bâwm hmaah tawtawrâwt an hâm reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, chumi ni chuan Davidan Lalpa hnêna lâwmthu hril tûrin Asapha leh a unaute chu a hmang ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw, Lalpa hnênah lâwmthu hril ula, Hnamte zîngah chuan a thiltihte chu hriattîr rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amah chawimawiin hla sa ula, amah fakin zai rawh u; A thilmak tih zawng zawng thu chu hril rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A hming thianghlim chu chhuang rawh u; Lalpa zawngtute thinlung chu hlim rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa leh a chakna chu zawng ula; A hmêl chu zawng fo rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thil ropui tak tihte hre reng ula, A thiltihte leh a kâa a rorêlte chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw, a chhiahhlawh Israela thlahho, Jakoba thlah, a thlante u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ani chu Lalpa kan Pathian chu a ni a; A thupêkte chu khawvêl pum huap a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thuthlun chu kumkhuain hre reng ula, Chhuan sâng thlenga a thu lo pêk,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abrahama hnêna a thuthlun leh, Isaaka hnêna a chhechham chu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chu vêk chu Jakoba hnêna thuruatah, Israela hnêna kumkhaw thuthlung atân a tinghet a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Kanaan ram hi ka pe ang che, I ro chanpual tûr ram chu,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi tlêm tê chauh in niha, A ni, tlêm tê, khualzin ang mai in nih lai khân;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hnam hrang hrang hnênah an kal lâwr a, Ram hrang hrang aṭangin mi hrang hrang hnênah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tu ma hnehchhiah a phal lo va; A ni, anmahni avângin lalte pawh a zilhhau va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Ka hriak thihate chu tawk suh ula, Ka zâwlneite pawi rêng rêng khawih suh u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Leilung luah zawng zawngte u, Lalpa chawimawiin hla sa ula; Ni tin a chhandamna thu chu hriattîr rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hnam tin zîngah a ropuizia hril ula, Mi tinrêngte zîngah a thilmak tihte chu hril rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpa chu a ropui a, nasa taka fak tûr a ni si a; Pathian zawng zawng aia ṭih tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hnamte pathian chu milem an ni si a; Lalpa erawh chuan vânte khi a siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chawimawina leh ropuina a hmaah a awm a; Chakna leh hlimna a hmun thianghlimah a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mi tina chi tinrêngte u, Lalpa chu bel ula, Lalpa chu ropuina leh chakna bel rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lalpa chu a hming ropuina bel ula; Thilhlan tûr keng ula, a hmaah lo kal rawh u; Thianghlim mawina inbelin Lalpa chu chibai bûk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Leilung zawng zawngte u, a hmaah khûr rawh u! Khawvêl hi a nghîn theih lohna tûrin tihnghehin a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Vânte khi lâwm takin awm sela, Lei pawh hi hlim takin awm rawh se; Hnam tin zîngah chuan, “ Lalpa chuan ro a rêl,” ti rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuifinriat leh a chhûnga thil awm zawng zawng hi ri hum hum sela; Lo leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawng hi lâwm takin awm rawh se!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan ramhnuaia thing zawng zawng hi, Lalpa hmaah chuan hlimin an zai ang, Lei ro rêl tûrin a lo kal dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Aw, Lalpa hnênah lâwmthu hril rawh u, ani chu a ṭha si a; A ngilneihna pawh kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Aw, kan chhandamna Pathian, min chhandam la, I hming thianghlim fak tûr leh, I fakawmna chhuang tûrin, Hnam tin zîng ata min hruai khâwm la, min chhan him ang che,” ti rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Israel-te Pathian Lalpa chu fakin awm rawh se, Chatuan ata chatuan thleng pawhin. Tin, mipui zawng zawng chuan, “Amen,” an ti a, Lalpa chu an fak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chutichuan, chuta Lalpa thuthlunna bâwm hmaa ni tin a ṭûl dân ang anga rawngbâwl tûrin, Davida chuan Asapha leh a unaute a dah ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Obed-edoma leh Hosa, an unau sawmruk leh pariatten an pui tûr a ni a, Jeduthuna fapa Obed-edoma leh Hosa-te chu kawngkhâr vêngtu tûr an ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lalpan Israel-hote thu a pêk, Lalpa dâna ziak zawng zawng anga hâlral thilhlan maichâm chunga tûk leh zâna, Gibeon hmun sânga Lalpa biak bûk hmaa hâlral thilhlante hlân reng tûr atân erawh chuan, puithiam Zadoka leh, a unau puithiamhote ruat an ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />an zînga tela, a khawngaihna chu kumkhua atân a nih avânga Lalpa hnêna lâwmthu sawi tûrin Hemana leh Jeduthuna leh mi dang, an hming lama thlan chhuahte chu ruat an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hemana leh Jeduthuna-te chu tawtawrâwt te, dârbenthek te leh thil tum chi dangte ruala tum tûr kawltu an ni a. Jeduthuna leh a fate chu kawngkhâr vêngtu tûr an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tichuan, mipui zawng zawng chu mahni in lam ṭheuhvah an haw ta a; tin, Davida pawh chu a chhûngte malsâwm tûrin a haw ve ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Davida chu a ina a awm laiin zâwlnei Nathana hnênah Davida chuan, “Hei, kei chu sidar thing inah ka awm a; nimahsela, Lalpa thuthlunna bâwm chu puan zâr hnuai maiah a awm a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Nathana chuan Davida hnênah, “I rilrua i vei ang tak chuan ti ta che; Pathian i hnênah a awm si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, chumi zân vêk chuan heti hi a ni a, Nathana hnênah Pathian thu a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka chhiahhlawh Davida chu va hrilh rawh, ‘ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Ka awmna tûrin nangin in mi saksak tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israela thlahte Aigupta ram ata ka hruai chhuah aṭangin tûn thlengin inah ka awm lo va; puan in leh biak bûkah ka awm zêl zâwk ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel-ho zawng zawngte nêna kan kalna rêng rêngah pawh, ka mite châwm tûra thu ka pêk Israel-ho rorêltute hnênah, “Engati nge sidar thingin in mi sak loh?” ka ti ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Chuvângin, ka chhiahhlawh Davida hnênah heti hian sawi rawh, ‘Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti a ni, Berâm tlatna hmun ata i berâm vêng lai chu ka mi Israel-te chunga lal tûrin ka la chia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />i kalna apiangah i hnênah ka awm zêl a, i hmêlmate ka tihbosak zêl chia, leia mi ropui takte angin hming ropui tak ka siamsak dâwn che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ka mi Israel-te tân hmun ka ruat ang a, insuan tawh lova anmahni pual hmuna an awm reng theih nân anni chu ka phun ang a; tûn hmaa ka mi Israel-te chunga rorêltute ka ruat laia suahsualna faten an ti ṭhîn ang khân, an tirethei tawh hek lo vang a; i hmêlma zawng zawngte pawh ka titlâwm bawk ang. Tin, chu lo pawh chu Lalpa chuan chhûngkua a dinsak ang che tih ka hrilh che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, i ni a kina, i pi leh pute hnêna i kal hunah chuan, heti hi a ni ang a, i hnua i thlah, i fate zînga mi chu ka tungding ang a; tin, a ram chu ka tinghet ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ani chuan in mi saksak ang a; tin, a lalṭhutthlêng chu kumkhuain ka tinghet ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, a pa ka ni ang a, ani chu ka fapa a ni ang a; ka zahngaihna i hmaa mi ka lâk bosak ang khân, ani zawng ka lâk bosak lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ka inah leh ka ramah ani chu kumkhuain ka din nghet ang a; tin, a lalṭhutthlêng chu kumkhuaa tihngheh a ni ang, tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chûng thu zawng zawng leh chu inlârna ang chiah chuan Nathana chuan Davida hnênah a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Davida chu a lût a, Lalpa hmaah chuan a ṭhu a, “Aw, Lalpa Pathian, tu nge maw ka niha, ka chhûngte pawh tu nge maw an niha, heti chen chen mi hruai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aw Pathian, chûng pawh chu nanga mit hmuhah chuan thil tê tham zawng a ni a; nimahsela, aw Lalpa Pathian, i chhiahhlawh chhûngkaw lo awm dân tûr thu chu kum tam tak chhûng atân i lo sawi tawh a, mi lian angah mi ngai bawk a, aw Lalpa Pathian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh chawimawia a awm chungchâng thûah hian Davidan i hnênah eng nge a sawi leh cheu vang? I chhiahhlawh hi i hre chiang hle si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i chhiahhlawh avângin nangma rilrua chhuak ang zêlin hêng thil ropui tak hi hriattîr tûrin thil ropui tak takte i ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , kan hriatah chuan nangmah ang rêng rêng an awm lo va, nangmah lo chu Pathian rêng rêng an awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aigupta ram ata i tlan chhuah i mite hmaa hnam dangte titlâwma, thil ropui tak leh hlauhawm takte tia hming ropui tak siamsak tûr chea Pathianin ama mite atâna a tlan chhuah, i mi Israel-te ang rêng rêng hi khawvêlah hnam dang tu nge awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />I mi Israel-te chu kumkhuaa i mite atân i lo siam ta si a; nang Lalpa chu an Pathian i lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, aw Lalpa , i chhiahhlawh chungchâng thu leh a chhûngte chungchâng thu i sawi chu kumkhua atân tinghet la, i sawi tawh ang khân ti ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, ‘Sipaihote Pathian chu Israel-te Pathian, Israel-te tan ngeia Pathian a ni,’ tiin i hming chu kumkhuaa tihngheha chawimawiin awm sela; i chhiahhlawh Davida chhûngte chu i hmaa tihnghehin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aw nang ka Pathian, i chhiahhlawh hnênah chhûngkua i dinsak ang tih i lo puang tawh si a; chuvângin, i chhiahhlawh hi i hnênah ka la ṭawngṭai ngam ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nang chu Pathian i ni a, he thil ṭha hi i chhiahhlawh chu i lo tiam tawh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />i chhiahhlawh chhûngte chu i hmaa kumkhuaa an awm reng theih nân mal i lo sâwm ta a; aw Lalpa , nangin mal i sâwm chu kumkhaw malsâwmna a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chumi hnuah chuan heti hi a ni a, Davidan Philistia mite chu a bei a, a hneh a, Gath khua leh a khawperte chu Philistia mite a chhuhsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Moab-ho a bei leh a, Moab mite chu Davida chhiah khua an lo ni ta a, chhiahte an pe ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Euphrates luia a ram din nghet tûra a kal pahin, Zoba lal Hadadezera pawh Hamath bulah a bei leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, Davida chuan tawlailîr sângkhat leh sakawr chung chuang mi sângsarih leh sipai sînghnih a mansak a; tin, Davida chuan tawlailîr hnûk mi sakawr zawng zawng chu an tha a chhahsak a, tawlailîr za hnûk tûr erawh chu a zuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Damaska-a Suria mite chu Zoba lal Hadadezera chhan tûrin an lo kal a; tin, Davidan Suria mi sînghnih leh sânghnih a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan Damaska-a Suria mite zîngah chuan sipai a dah a; tichuan, Suria mite chu Davida chhiah khua an lo ni a, chhiahte an pe ṭhîn a. Tin, Lalpa chuan Davida chu a kalna apiangah a hnehtîr zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Hadadezera ho rangkachak phawte a lâksak a, Jerusalem-ah a hâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Hadadezera khua Tibhath leh Kun-a mi Davida chuan dâr tam tak a hâwn a, chûng chuan Solomonan dâr tuizêm, a hûnna leh a suahna dâr note a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Hamath lal Toua chuan Zoba lal Hadadezera sipai zawng zawng Davidan a hneh tih a lo hria a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hadadezera a rûna, a thah avânga chibai bûk tûr leh lawmpui tûrin a fapa Hadorama chu Davida hnênah a tîr a, Hadadezera leh Toua chu indo ṭhîn an ni si a; rangkachak leh tangkarua leh dâr bungbêl tinrêng a kensak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chûngte pawh chu ram dang a ngam zawng zawnga mi tangkarua leh rangkachak a lâkte nên chuan Davidan Lalpa hnênah a hlân a: Edom-ho laka mi te, Moab-ho laka mi te, Amona thlahte laka mi te, Philistia-ho laka mi te, Amelek-ho laka mi te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chu lo pawh, Zeruii fapa Abisaian Edom-ho sîngkhat leh sângriat Chi Ruamah a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Edom ramah chuan sipaite a dah a; tichuan, Edom mi zawng zawng chu Davida chhiah khua an lo ni ta a. Tin, Lalpan Davida chu a kalna apiangah a hnehtîr zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan Israel mi zawng zawng chungah ro a rêl a; a mi zawng zawng chungah chuan fel takin ro a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zeruii fapa Joaba chu sipai hotu ber a ni a; Ahiluda fapa Jehosaphata chu chanchin ziaktu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahituba fapa Zadoka leh Abiathara fapa Abimeleka chu puithiam an ni a, Savsa chu ziaktu a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jehoiada fapa Benaia chu Kereth mi leh Peleth mite hotu a ni a; Davida fapate chu lal thu zai satu ber an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chûng hnuah chuan heti hi a ni a, Amona thlahte lal Nahasa chu a thi a, a fapa chu a aiawhin a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan, “A pa chuan mi lo khawngaih ṭhin avângin kei pawhin Nahasa fapa Hanuna chu ka khawngaih ve ang,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Davida chuan a pa chungchâng thûa thlamuan tûrin mite a tîr a. Tin, Davida mite chuan Amona thlahte ramah Hanuna hnên chu amah thlamuan tûrin an va thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nimahsela, Amona thlah puipahote chuan Hanuna hnênah, “Davida hian i pa a zah avângin thlamuantu tûr i hnênah a rawn tîr niin i ring em ni? A mite hi ram tichhe tûra thlîthlai leh enthla tûra i hnêna lo kal an ni lâwng maw?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, Hanuna chuan Davida mite chu a man a, an khabe hmul a meh kâwnsak a; tin, an silhfênte chu a lai takah an mawngtam khuh pha chauhvin a tansak a, a hawtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, tuten emaw a mite a lo tih dân chu Davida an va hrilh a; tin, a hmuak tûrin mi a tîr a, anni lah chu an zak hle mai si a. Tin, lal chuan, “In khabe hmul a chawr sei hma chu Jeriko-ah awm rih ula, chumi hnuah chuan in lo haw a ni ang chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Amona thlahten Davida huat zâwng an ni ta tih an lo inhriat chuan, Hanuna leh Amona thlahte chuan Mesopotamia rama mite, Aram-maaka-a mite, Zoba-a mi te, tawlailîr leh sakawr chung chuang mite rawih nân tangkaraw talent sângkhat an thawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, tawlailîr sîngthum leh sânghnih Maaka lal leh a mite nên an ruai a, Medeba bulah ṭanhmun an khuar a. Tin, Amona thlahte chu an khua aṭangte chuan an chhuak a, an pung khâwm a, indo tûrin an thawk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Davidan chu chu a hriatin, Joaba leh sipai huaisenho zawng zawngte chu a tîr chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Amona thlahte chu an lo thawk a, khawpui kawngkhâr bulah an inzâr a; tin, lalho lo tel vete chu a hrangin phûlah an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, a hma lam leh hnung lamah an rawn bei dâwn tih Joaban a hriatin, Israel mite zînga mi a ṭha ṭha a thlang chhuak a, Suria mite bei tûrin an lo inzâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, mi dang zawng zawng chu a unaupa Abisaia kutah a dah vek a, Amona thlahte bei tûrin an inzâr bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Suria mite hi ka chelh dâwn loh chuan, nangin mi pui ang a; tin, Amona thlahte i chelh dâwn loh chuan, ka rawn pui thung ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huai takin awm ula, kan mite leh kan Pathian khuate chhanin i intipachang ang u; tin, Lalpan ṭha a tih ang zêlin ti rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Joaba leh a hnêna mite chuan indona hmun lama Suria mite chu an va hnaih a; tin, a hmaah chuan an tlânchhe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Amona thlahten Suria mite an tlânchhia tih an han hmuh chuan, anni pawh chu a unaupa Abisaia hmaah chuan an tlânchhe ve ta a, khuaah an lût a. Tichuan, Joaba chu Jerusalem-ah a haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Suria miten Israel-te hmaah an chan a chhe ta tih an lo hriat chuan, mi an tîr a, Lui piah lama Suria-hote chu an ko chhuak a; tin, Hadadezera sipai hotu Sophaka chu an hotu ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, chu chu Davida an hrilh a; tin, ani chuan Israel mi zawng zawng a ko khâwm a, Jordan lui an kai a, an va hmu a, bei tûrin an inzâr a. Chutichuan, Davida hote chu an han inzâr zawh chuan Suria-hote chu an bei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Suria mite chu Israel-te hmaah chuan an tlânchhe ta a; tin, Davida chuan Suria mi, tawlailîr sângsarih chunga chuang leh sipai sîngli a that a; tin, sipai hotu Sophaka pawh a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, Hadadezera mite chuan Israel-te hmaah an chan a chhe ta tih an lo hriat chuan, Davida nên inremna an siam a, chhiah khuaah an awm ta a; Suria mite pawh chuan Amona thlahte chu an pui leh duh ta lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, kum a lo veia, lalte indo tûra an chhuah ṭhin lai hun chuan, Joaban sipai rûnpui a hruai chhuak a, Amona thlahte ram chu a chhu chhia a, Raba khua an hual a. Davida erawh chu Jerusalem-ah a awm a. Tin, Joaba chuan Raba khua chu a bei a, a la ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan an lal lallukhum khum lai chu a lâksak a, a rih lam chu rangkachak talent khat a ni a, lunghlute pawh a tel a; tin, Davida an khumtîr a; tin, khawpuia mi râllâk sum tam tak chu a la bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, chuta mipuite chu a kawi chhuak a, thing zaina te, lei lehna thîr zum te, hreipuitein hna a thawhtîr a. Chutiang chuan Amona thlah khawpui zawng zawng chu Davidan a ti a. Tin, Davida leh mi zawng zawng chu Jerusalem-ah an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chumi hnuah chuan Philistia mite nên Gezer-ah indona a awm a; tichuan, Husath mi Sibekaian mi lian thlahte zînga mi Sippaia a that a. Tin, an tlâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Philistia mite nêna indona a awm leh a; tin, Jaira fapa Elhananan Git mi Goliatha unaupa Lahmia a that a, a fei ngul chu lian tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Gath khuaah indona a awm leh a, chutah chuan mi sâng tak mai, a kut lehlam lehlama zungṭang paruk, a ke lehlam lehlama zungṭang paruk, a vaia sawmhnih leh pali nei hi a awm a; ani pawh mi lian laka piang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan Israel mite a va cho va, Davida unau Simeia fapa Jonathana chuan a lo that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chûngte chu Gath khuaa mi lian laka piang an ni a; chûng chu Davida leh a mite kutah an thi a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Setanan Israel-te chu a bei a, Davida chu Israel-te chhiar duhna a neihtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Joaba leh a mi liante hnênah, “Kal ula, Beer-seba aṭanga Dan thlengin Israel mite chhiar ula, a zât ka hriat theih nân mi rawn hrilh leh ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Joaba chuan lal hnênah, “ Lalpan a mite hi a leh za pawhin tipung sela, lalpa ka pu, ka pu mite vek an ni lâwm ni? Ka puin chu chu engah nge maw hriat a châk le? Eng atân nge Israel-te thiam loh chan phahna a nih ang le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, lal thu chuan Joaba chu a hneh ta a. Chutichuan, Joaba chu a chhuak a, Israel ram zawng zawngah chuan a kal a, Jerusalem-ah a haw leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Joaba chuan mihring awm zât chu Davida a hrilh a. Israel rama khandaih keng mi zawng zawng chu maktaduai khat leh nuai khat an ni a; tin, Judai rama khandaih keng mi chu nuai li leh sîngsarih an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Levi-ho leh Benjamin-ho erawh chu a chhiar tel ve lo; lal thu chu Joaba huat zâwng tak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, chu thilah chuan Pathian a lâwm ta lo va; chutichuan, Israel-ho chu a hrem ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Davidan Pathian hnênah, “He ka thil lo tihah hian nasa takin ka lo sual ta a ni; nimahsela, i chhiahhlawh khawlohna hi khawngaih takin ngaidam ang che, âtthlâk takin ka lo ti ta a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Davida zâwlnei, Gada hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Kal la, Davida hnênah, ‘ Lalpan heti hian a ti: Thil kawng thum ka ruatsak a che; i chunga ka tih tûrin a pakhat chu thlang rawh, a ti e,’ ti rawh,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, Gada chu Davida hnênah a kal a, a hnênah, “ Lalpan heti hian a ti: ‘A eng nge i duh thlang rawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />kum thum ṭâm tlâk nge, i hmêlmate khandaiha ûm phâka awma, thla thum i hmêlmaten an tihtlâwm che nge, ni thum chhûng hri, Lalpa khandaiha Lalpa vântirhkohvin Israel ram zawng zawnga mi tihboral zêl?’ tiin. Chutichuan, mi tîrtu chu engtin nge ka chhân dâwn, inngaihtuah la, mi hrilh rawh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan Gada hnênah, “Ka mang a ang hle mai. Lalpa kutah tlu lût phawt mai ila, a zahngaihna hi a nasa hle si a; mihring kutah chuan min tlûk luhtîr lul suh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpan Israel-te zîngah chuan hri a lêntîr ta a; Israel-hote chu sîngsarih an thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem khua tichhe tûrin Pathianin vântirhkoh a tîr a; tin, a han tihchhiat dâwn lai tak chuan, Lalpa chuan a han en a, thil ṭha lo tih a tum chu a lamlêt a, mite tiboraltu vântirhkoh hnênah chuan, “A tâwk tawh e; i kut lek tawh suh,” a ti a. Tin, Lalpa vântirhkoh chu Jebus mi Ornana hruih bulah chuan a ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Davida chu a han dâk a, Lalpa vântirhkoh, khandaih phawi saa Jerusalem lam tina, lei leh vân inkâra ding a hmu a. Chutichuan, Davida leh upaho chu saiip puan sinin leiah an bawkkhup ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Davidan Pathian hnênah, “Keimah hi a ni lâwm ni, mipuite chhiar tûr tih thu petu chu? Keimah hi a ni, thil lo tisuala, suahsualthlâk taka thil lo ti ta chu; hêng berâmte hian eng thil nge an tih ve? Aw Lalpa ka Pathian, keimah leh ka chhûngte chungah i kut thlâk zâwk la, i mite hian hri hi tuar tawh suh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa vântirhkohvin Gada hnênah Davida chu han chhova, Jebus mi Ornana hruiha Lalpa tâna maichâm han siam tûra Davida hrilh tûrin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Gadan Lalpa hminga a sawi ang chuan Davida chu a chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Ornana chu a han lehhawi a, vântirhkoh chu a hmu a; tin, a fapa pali a hnêna awm vete chu an biru a, Ornana erawh chuan buh a lo chîl mêk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Davidan Ornana hnên a va thlen chuan, Ornana chu a han hawi a, Davida chu a hmu ta a; tin, hruih ata chu a chhuak a, a hmaia lei siin Davida hmaah chuan a bawkkhup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, Davidan Ornana hnênah, “He hruih hi Lalpa tâna maichâm ka siam nân mi pe rawh khai; a man kim chiah têlin mi pe rawh, mipuite laka hri a kian theihna tûr hian,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Ornanan Davida hnênah chuan, “Nei mai rawh, lalpa ka pu chuan âwm a tih ang angin ti rawh se. En teh, hâlrala hlan atân bâwngpa te, thing atân hrui hmanrua te, chhangphut thilhlan atân buhte ka pe ang che; ka tum vek ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Lal Davidan Ornana hnênah chuan, “Ni lo ve a; a man kim chiahin ka lei zâwk ang e, man lovin i ta chu Lalpa tân ka la lo vang a, hâlral thilhlan pawh ka hlân lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davidan chumi hmun lei nân chuan Ornana chu rangkachak sekel zaruk a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Davidan chutah chuan Lalpa tân maichâm a siam ta a, hâlral thilhlante leh remna thilhlante a hlân a, Lalpa a au va; tin, ani chu maichâm chunga meiin vân aṭangin a rawn chhâng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan vântirhkoh chu thu a pe a, a khandaih chu a paiah a khung leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Davidan Jebus mi Ornana hruihah Lalpan a rawn chhâng tih a hriatin chutah chuan a inthawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan Mosian thlalêra Lalpa biak bûk leh hâlral thilhlanna maichâm a siam kha Gibeon khuaa hmun sângah a awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nimahsela, Davida chu Lalpa vântirhkoh khandaih a hlauh avângin Pathian râwn tûrin chutah chuan a kal thei lo a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Davidan, “Hei hi Lalpa Pathian in a lo ni a, hei hi Israel-te hâlral thilhlanna maichâm a lo nih hi le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davidan Israel rama hnam dang awmte chu koh khâwm thu a pe a; tin, Pathian in sakna tûrin lungchhertute chu lung a chhertîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan kawt hung kawngkhâr leh a vuah nân a kilhna tûr thîr tam tak a lo siam khâwl a, dâr tam tak bûk sên loh nên,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />sidar thing chhiar sên loh nên; Zidon mi leh Tura miten Davida hnênah chuan sidar thing tam tak an rawn la a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Davidan, “Ka fapa Solomona hi a la naupangin, eng mah a la hre rih lo va, Lalpa in sak tûr chu ropui tak, a hming leh a ropuina chu ram tina thang chhuak tûr a ni a; chuvângin, ka lo buatsaih lâwk dâwn e,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Davida chuan a thih hmain a lo buatsaih lâwk nasa hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, a fapa Solomona a ko va, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian in sa tûr chuan thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Davidan a fapa Solomona hnênah chuan, “ Lalpa ka Pathian tân hian in sak ka lo rilrûk ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nimahsela, ‘Nang zawngin thisen i chhuah nasa êm a, indote i uar êm êm a; lei chungah hian ka mit hmuha thisen i chhuah nasat avângin, ka tân in i sa lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai teh, fapa i la nei ang a, ani chu remna duh mi a ni ang a, a vêl rama a hmêlmate zawng zawng lakah chuan râlmuanna ka pe ang; a hming chu Solomona a ni ang a, ama chhanah chuan Israel-hote chu râlmuang leh thlamuang takin ka awmtîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ani chuan ka tân in a sa ang a, ani chu ka fapa a ni ang a, kei a pa ka ni ang; tin, Israel-te chunga a ram lalṭhutthlêng chu kumkhua atân ka tinghet ang,’ tiin Lalpa thu ka hnênah a lo thleng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, ka fapa, Lalpa chu i hnênah awm sela; hmuingîl zêl la, i chungchâng thu a lo sawi lâwk tawh ang khân, Lalpa i Pathian in chu sa ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpan finna leh hriatnate neihtîr phawt che sela, Israel-te chunga thuneihna pe che rawh se; tichuan, Lalpa i Pathian dân chu i zâwm thei dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel-te chungchâng thûa thuruatte leh rorêlnate Lalpan Mosia a pêk kha i zawm chuan, i hmuingîl zêl ang. Chak takin awm la, huai takin awm rawh; hlau suh la, zâm hek suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngai teh, ka mangan laiin Lalpa in atân rangkachak talent nuai khat leh, tangkaraw talent maktaduai khat ka lo buatsaih tawh a; tin, dâr leh thîrte pawh bûk sên loh, tam tak a ni; thing leh lung pawh ka buatsaih lâwk tawh a; chûng chu i chhunzawm thei tawh ang chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, hnathawktu, thing zaitute leh lung chhertute leh themthiam hna tinrêng thawk thei i ngah bawk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />chhiar sên rual loh rangkachak te, tangkarua te, dâr te, thîrte pawh. Bei nghâl mai rawh khai, Lalpa chu i hnênah awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Davida chuan Israel-ho puipate zawng zawng chu a fapa Solomona ṭanpui tûrin thu a pe a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathian chu in hnênah a awm lâwm ni? Kil tin kil tangah râlmuanna a pe lo che u em ni? He rama mite hi ka kutah a rawn hlân ta a, ram chu Lalpa hmaah leh a mite hmaah lâk a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, in thinlung leh in rilruin Lalpa in Pathian lam hawi ula; bei nghâl ula, Lalpa thuthlung bâwm leh Pathian bungbêl thianghlimte chu Lalpa tâna in in sak tûra in lâk luh theih nân Lalpa Pathian hmun thianghlim chu siam rawh u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Davida chu a dam reiin a lo upa ta hle a; tichuan, a fapa Solomona chu Israel-te lalah a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Israel-ho puipa zawng zawng chu puithiamte leh Levi-hote nên a ko khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Levi-hote chu kum sawmthum achin chung lam chhiar an ni a; an tam lam chu patling sîngthum leh sângriat an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chûng zînga sînghnih leh sângli chu Lalpa in satuho hotu tûr an ni a, sângrukte chu hotute leh rorêltu tûrte an ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />sânglite chu kawngkhâr vêngtu tûrte an ni a; tin, sânglite chu, “Fakna tûra thil tum rîk chi ka siam,” Davidan a tihte hmanga Lalpa faktu tûrte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Levia fa Gersona te, Kohatha te, Meraria te zâtin Davidan pâwl a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gerson mite chu Ladana leh Simeia an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ladana fate chu puipa ber Jehiela te, Zethama te, Joela te, pathum an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Simeia fate chu Selomotha te, Haziela te, Harana te, pathum an ni. Hêngte hi Ladana thlah chhûngkaw puipate chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Simeia fate chu Jahatha te, Zina te, Jeusa te, Beria te an ni. Hêng palite hi Simeia fate chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Jahatha chu a upa ber a ni a, Ziza chu a chhang a ni. Jeusa leh Beria erawh chuan fa an ngah lo va; chuvângin, chhûngkaw pakhat anga chhiar an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kohatha fate chu Amrama te, Izara te, Hebrona te, Uziela te, pali an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amrama fate chu Arona leh Mosia an ni; Arona chu, amah leh a thlahte chu kumkhua atâna thil thianghlim takte tithianghlima, kumkhuaa Lalpa hmaa rimtui hâla, a rawng bâwla, a hminga malsâwmtu tûra tihhran an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian mi Mosia erawh chu, a fate chu Levi hnam zînga chhiar an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mosia fate chu Gersoma leh Eliezera an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gersoma fate zînga upa ber chu Sebuela a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Eliezera fate zînga upa ber chu Rehabia a ni. Eliezera chuan fapa dang rêng rêng a nei lo; Rehabia erawh chuan fapa tam tak a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Izhara fate zîng upa ber chu Selomitha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hebrona fatea upa ber chu Jeria a ni a, a chhang chu Amaria, a chhang leh chu Jahaziela, a chhang leh chu Jekameama a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Uziela fatea upa zâwk chu Mika a ni a, a chhang chu Isia a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Meraria fate chu Mahlia leh Musia an ni. Mahlia fate chu Eleazara leh Kisa an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Eleazara chu a thi a, fapate nei lovin fanute chauh a nei a; tin, Kisa fapa, an unauten nupuiah an nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Musia fate chu Mahlia te, Edera te, Jeremotha te, pathum an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chûngte chu Levia thlah, an chhûngkua ang zêla hming ziaka an chhiar chhûngkaw puipa, Lalpa in saka thawk, kum sawmhnih achin chung lama chhiar zawngte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Davidan, “ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathianin a mite chu râlmuang takin a awmtîr ta a, Jerusalem-ah hian a awm ta reng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Levi-hote pawh hian biak bûk leh a rawngbâwl nân bungbêl zawng zawng hi an zâwn a ngai tawh lo ve,” a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Davida thupêk hnuhnûng avângin Levi-hote chu kum sawmhnih achin chung lam thlengin chhiar an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An hnathawh chu Pathian ina rawngbâwla Arona fapate ṭanpuia, kawt hung chhûng leh pindan chhûnga thil thianghlim zawng zawng tihthianghlima, Lalpa ina rawngbâwl a ni si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />chhang chhiah tûr te, chhangphut thilhlan atâna chhangphut dip tak, dawidim telh loh chhangpêr pan emaw, bêla ur emaw, kan emaw, a teh leh a lenzia ang zawng zawng tûr buatsaih vêl te nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tin, tûk tina Lalpa hnêna lâwmthu sawi leh amah fak te nên, tlaiah pawh chuti bawk;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />tin, Chawlhniah te, thla tharah te, kût bi neiah te, a tih tûra ruat ang zêla Lalpa hnêna hâlral thilhlan zawng zawng Lalpa hmaa hlan reng te nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />tin, inbiakna puan in enkawl te, hmun thianghlim enkawl te, Lalpa ina rawngbâwla an unau Arona fapaten tih tûr an ruat apiang tih te nên.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Arona fapate pâwl ṭhen dân chu hetiang hi a ni. Arona fapate chu Nadaba te, Abihua te, Eleazara te, Ithamara te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nadaba leh Abihua erawh chu an pa aiin an thi hmasa a, fa an nei lo; chuvângin, Eleazara leh Ithamara chuan puithiam hna an thawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Davidan Eleazara fapa Zadoka leh Ithamara fapa Ahimeleka te nên an rawngbâwl dân tûr a semsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Ithamara thlahte ai chuan Eleazara thlah puipaa ṭang an tam zâwk a, hetiang hian an ṭhen a: Eleazara thlaha mi, chhûngkaw puipa chu sâwm leh paruk an ni a; tin, Ithamara thlaha mi, chhûngkaw puipa chu pariat an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutiang chuan ṭhumvâwrin, ai khata luangin an ṭhen a; Eleazara thlaha mi leh Ithamara thlaha mite zîngah, hmun thianghlima mi liante leh Pathian mi liante an awm ve ve si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Levi mi, lehkhaziaktu, Nethanela fapa Semaian lal leh mi lianhote: puithiam Zadoka te, Abiathara fapa Ahimeleka te, puithiamho leh Levi-ho chhûngkaw puipate mit hmuhah chuan a ziak a; chhûngkaw puipa pakhat chan chu Eleazara chungah a tlu a, pakhat chu Ithamara chungah a tlu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, ṭhumvâwr vawi khatna chu Jehoiariba chungah a tlu a, vawi hnihna chu Jedaia chungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />vawi thumna chu Harima chungah, vawi lina chu Seorima chungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />vawi ngana chu Malkija chungah, vawi rukna chu Mijamina chungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />vawi sarihna chu Hakoza chungah, vawi riatna chu Abija chungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />vawi kuana chu Jesua chungah, vawi sâwmna chu Sekania chungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />vawi sâwm leh vawi khatna chu Eliasiba chungah, vawi sâwm leh vawi hnihna chu Jakima chungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />vawi sâwm leh vawi thumna chu Hupa chungah, vawi sâwm leh vawi lina chu Jesebeaba chungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />vawi sâwm leh vawi ngana chu Bilga chungah, vawi sâwm leh vawi rukna chu Imera chungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />vawi sâwm leh vawi sarihna chu Hezira chungah, vawi sâwm leh vawi riatna chu Hapizeza chungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />vawi sâwm leh vawi kuana chu Pethahia chungah, vawi sawmhnihna chu Jehezkela chungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />vawi sawmhnih leh vawi khatna chu Jakina chungah, vawi sawmhnih leh vawi hnihna chu Gamula chungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />vawi sawmhnih leh vawi thumna chu Delaia chungah, vawi sawmhnih leh vawi lina chu Maazia chungah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chu chu Lalpa , Israel Pathianin an pu Arona thu a lo pêk, Lalpa in chhûnga rawng an bâwl dân tûr a lo ruat dân chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Levia thlah dangte zînga mi chu: Amrama fate zingah chuan Subaela a ni; Subaela fate zîngah Jehdeia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Rehabia lamah chuan: Rehabia-hote zîngah puipa Isia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Izhar-ho zîngah Selomotha; Selomotha fate zîngah Jahatha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hebrona fate chu, a upa ber Jeria a ni a, a chhang Amaria, a chhang leh Jahaziela, a chhang leh Jekameama a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Uziela fate zînga mi Mika; Mika fate zînga mi Samira a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mika unaupa chu Isia a ni a; Isia fate zînga mi Zekaria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Meraria fate chu Mahlia leh Musia an ni: Jaazia fate zînga mi Benoa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Meraria thlahte chu, Jaazia lakah Benoa te, Sohama te, Zakura te, Ibria te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mahlia lakah Eleazara a ni a, ani chuan fapa a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kisa lakah chuan Kisa fapa Jerameela a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Musia thlahte chu, Mahlia te, Edera te, Jerimotha te an ni. Chûngte chu Levi-ho thlahte zînga an chhûngkaw puipate chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Anni pawh chuan Arona fa an unaute ang bawkin, Lal Davida te, Zadoka te, Ahimeleka te, puithiamho leh Levi-ho chhûngkaw puipate mit hmuhah ṭhum an vâwr ve bawk a; chhûngkaw puipa ber leh an unaute pawh ai khata luangin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Asapha te, Hemana te, Jeduthuna teho fapa ṭhenkhat chu ṭingṭang te, perhkhuang te, dârbenthek te nêna fak dual duala rawngbâwltu atân Davida leh sipai hotuten an tihrang bawk a. Chutianga thawka rawngbâwltute tam lam chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asapha fapate zînga mi chu: Zakura te, Josefa te, Nethania te, Asarela te an ni a; anni chu Asapha fate, lal thupêk anga fak dual dual ṭhîn, Asapha thû thûa awm an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jeduthuna lakah chuan, Jeduthuna fa: Gedalia te, Zeria te, Jesaia te, Simeia te, Hasabia te, Matithia te, paruk an ni, ṭingṭang nêna Lalpa hnêna lâwmthu sawia fak dual duala, an pa Jeduthuna thû thûa awm an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hemana lakah chuan, Hemana fa: Bukia te, Matania te, Uziela te, Sebuela te, Jerimotha te, Hanania te, Hanana te, Eliatha te, Gidaltia te leh Romamti-ezera te, Josbekasa te, Malothia te, Hothira te, Mahaziotha te an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chûng zawng zawng chu lal tâna zâwlnei Hemana fa, englo ki tawtawrâwt hâmtu tûrte an ni. Pathianin Hemana chu fapa sâwm leh pali leh fanu pathum a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûng zawng zawng chu Lalpa inah dârbenthek nên, perhkhuang nên, ṭingṭang nên, Pathian ina rawngbâwl nâna hla nêna remtu, an pa thû thûa awm an ni. Asapha te, Jeduthuna te, Hemana te chu lal thupêka awm an ni ve thung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, an tam lam chu, an unau, Lalpa tâna hla sak zir, thiam sa tawh zawng zawngte nên chuan zahnih leh sawmriat leh pariat an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a lian a tê, zirtîrtu leh zirtuin an chan tûr ang khat vekin ṭhum an vâwr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, ṭhumvâwr vawi khatna chu Asapha fapa Josefa chungah a tlu a; vawi hnihna chu Gedalia chungah, amah leh a unaute leh a fapate chu sâwm leh pahnih an ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />vawi thumna chu Zakura chungah, a fapate leh a unaute chu sâwm leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />vawi lina chu Izria chungah, a fapate leh a unaute chu sâwm leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />vawi ngana chu Nethania chungah, a fapate leh a unaute chu sâwm leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />vawi rukna chu Bukia chungah, a fapate leh a unaute chu sâwm leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />vawi sarihna chu Jesarela chungah, a fapate leh a unaute chu sâwm leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />vawi riatna chu Jesaia chungah, a fapate leh a unaute chu sâwm leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />vawi kuana chu Matania chungah, a fapate leh a unaute chu sâwm leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />vawi sâwmna chu Simeia chungah, a fapate leh a unaute chu sâwm leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />vawi sâwm leh vawi khatna chu Azarela chungah, a fapate leh a unaute chu sâwm leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />vawi sâwm leh vawi hnihna chu Hasabia chungah, a fapate leh a unaute chu sâwm leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />vawi sâwm leh vawi thumna chu Subaela chungah, a fapate leh a unaute chu sâwm leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />vawi sâwm leh vawi lina chu Matithia chungah, a fapate leh a unaute chu sâwm leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />vawi sâwm leh vawi ngana chu Jeremotha chungah, a fapate leh a unaute chu sâwm leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />vawi sâwm leh vawi rukna chu Hanania chungah, a fapate leh a unaute chu sâwm leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />vawi sâwm leh vawi sarihna chu Josbekasa chungah, a fapate leh a unaute chu sâwm leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />vawi sâwm leh vawi riatna chu Hanania chungah, a fapate leh a unaute chu sâwm leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />vawi sâwm leh vawi kuana chu Malothia chungah, a fapate leh a unaute chu sâwm leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />vawi sawmhnihna chu Eliatha chungah, a fapate leh a unaute chu sâwm leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />vawi sawmhnih leh vawi khatna chu Hothira chungah, a fapate leh a unaute chu sâwm leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />vawi sawmhnih leh vawi hnihna chu Gidaltia chungah, a fapate leh a unaute chu sâwm leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />vawi sawmhnih leh vawi thumna chu Mahaziotha chungah, a fapate leh a unaute chu sâwm leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />vawi sawmhnih leh vawi lina chu Romamti-ezera chungah, a fapate leh a unaute chu sâwm leh pahnih.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kawngkhâr vêngtu pâwl ṭhen dân chu: Kora mi chu Asapha fapate zînga Korea fapa Meselemia chuan fapate a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A fa tîr chu Zekaria a ni a, a dawttu chu Jediaela, a dawt lehtu chu Zebadia, a dawt lehtu chu Jathniela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a dawt lehtu chu Elama, a dawt lehtu chu Jehohanana, a dawt lehtu chu Eliehoenaia a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Obed-edoma chuan fapate a nei a: a fa tîr chu Semaia a ni a, a dawttu chu Jehozabada, a dawt lehtu chu Joa, a dawt lehtu chu Sakara, a dawt lehtu chu Nethanela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a dawt lehtu chu Amiela, a dawt lehtu chu Isakara, a dawt lehtu chu Peulethaia a ni a; ani chu Pathianin mal a sâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A fapa Semaia lakah chuan fapa, an chhûngkaw puipate an piang bawk a, mi chak huaisen an ni hlawm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Semaia fapate chu Othnia te, Rephaela te, Obeda te, Elzabada te an ni a, an unau Elihua leh Semakia chu mi chak tak an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chûng zawng zawng chu Obed-edoma thlahte an ni a, anmahni leh an fapate leh an unaute chu rawngbâwlna kawnga mi puitling an ni; Obed-edoma laka mite chu sawmruk leh pahnih an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Meselemia chuan fapa leh unau, mi chak tak tak sâwm leh pariat a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Meraria thlahte zînga Hosa chuan fapate a nei bawk a: Simria chu puipa ber a ni a (fa tîr a ni lo na a, a pain puipa berah a siam a ni),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a dawttu chu Hilkia a ni a, a dawt lehtu chu Tebalia, a dawt lehtu chu Zekaria a ni; Hosa fapate leh a unaute chu an zain sâwm leh pathum an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chûng puipaho zînga mi chu an unaute anga Lalpa ina rawngbâwl hnaa chanvo neia kawngkhâr vêngtu pâwla an ṭhente chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A lian a têin, an chhûngkaw zir ang zêlin kawngka tina awm tûr ṭhum an vâwr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, chhak lam atâna ṭhumvâwr chu Selemia chungah a tlu a. Tin, rorêltu fing tak, a fapa Zekaria tân ṭhum an vâwr a, hmâr lam chu a pualah a tlu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />chhim lam chu Obed-edoma pualah; tin, thil dah khâwmna in chu a fapate pualah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thlang lam chu a chhohna kawnga Saleketh kawngkhâr vênna nên, Supima leh Hosa pualah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chhak lamah Levi-ho paruk an awm a, ni tin hmâr lamah pali, ni tin chhim lamah pali; tin, thil dah khâwmna inah pahnih ve ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thlang lam in hual chhûng atân chuan a luhnaah pali, in hual chhûngah chuan pahnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chûngte chu an ni, Kora fapate leh Meraria fapate, kawngkhâr vêngtu pâwla an ṭhente chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, an unau Levi-ho, Pathian sum dah khâwmna in leh thil thianghlim dah khâwmna in vawngtute chu Ladana chhûngkaw puipa, Ladana laka Gerson mi thlah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jehielia leh a unau Zethama leh Joela-te an ni; chûngte chu Lalpa sum dah khâwmna in vawngtute an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amram-ho te, Izhar-ho te, Hebron-ho te, Uziel-ho te zînga mi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mosia fa Gersoma fapa Sebuela chu sum dah khâwmna in vawngtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, a unaute chu Eliezera fapa Rehabia te, Jesaia te, Jorama te, Zikria te, Selomitha te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Selomitha leh a unaute chu Lal Davida leh an chhûngkaw puipa, sipai sâng hotute leh za hotute leh sipai pâwl hotuten an tihthianghlim tawh, thil thianghlim dah khâwmna in zawng zawng vawngtu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Indonaa râllâk thilte chu Lalpa in siam ṭhat nân an dah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zâwlnei Samuela te, Kisa fapa Saula te, Nera fapa Abnera te, Zeruii fapa Joaba-tena an tihthianghlim zawng zawng, tu pawhin thil an tihthianghlim tawh phawt chu Selomitha leh a unaute vawn vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Izhar mi Kenania leh a fapate chu Israel ram pâwn lam chungchâng thûa hotute leh rorêltute an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hebron mi Hasabia leh a unau mi huaisen sângkhat leh zasarihte chu Jordan râl thlang lama Israel-ho awptu an ni; Lalpa hna zawng zawng leh lal rawngbâwlna lam hnaah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hebron thlahte hruaitu ber chu Jeria a ni a. Davida lal kum sawmli kum khân Hebron thlahte chhui chhuahna a awm a, Gilead rama Jazer-ah chuan an zîngah mi chak huaisen an lo awm ṭeuh mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Davida chuan Jeria chhûngte zînga mi huaisente chu mi sânghnih leh zasarih a thlang chhuak a, chûng mite chu Jordan lui khawchhak lam Reuben-hote, Gad-hote leh chhak lam Manase-hote rama Israel-te sakhaw thu leh tualchhûng thu rêl tûrin a ruat a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel-ho an tam chin chu chhûngkaw puipa te, sipai sâng hotu te, za hotu te leh lal rawngbâwltu zawng zawng, kum khat chhûnga thla tina inthlâk zêl ṭhîn, pâwl tina mi chu sînghnih leh sângli an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pâwl khatna thla khatnaa hotu chu Zabdiela fapa Jasobeama a ni a, a pâwlah chuan sînghnih leh sângli an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani chu Pereza thlaha mi, thla khatnaa sipai hotu zawng zawng hotu ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thla hnihnaa pâwl hotu chu Aho mi Dodaia a ni a, Miklotha pawh a pâwl hotu a ni; a pâwlah chuan sînghnih leh sângli an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thla thumnaa sipaihote hotu ber chu puithiam Jehoiada fapa Benaia a ni a, a pâwlah chuan sînghnih leh sângli an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />He Benaia hi a ni, sawmthumte zînga mi huaisen, sawmthumte chunga mi chu; a pâwlah chuan a fapa Amizabada a tel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thla linaa sipai hotu chu Joaba unaupa Asahela a ni a, a fapa Zebadian a zui a ni; tin, a pâwlah chuan sînghnih leh sângli an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thla nganaa sipai hotu chu Izra mi Samhutha a ni a; a pâwlah chuan sînghnih leh sângli an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thla ruknaa sipai hotu chu Teko mi, Ikesa fapa Ira a ni a; tin, a pâwlah chuan sînghnih leh sângli an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thla sarihnaa sipai hotu chu Ephraima thlah Pelon mi Heleza a ni a, a pâwlah chuan sînghnih leh sângli an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thla riatnaa sipai hotu chu Zera thlah, Husath mi Sibekaia a ni a; a pâwlah chuan sînghnih leh sângli an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thla kuanaa sipai hotu chu Benjamina thlah Anathoth mi Abiezera a ni a; a pâwlah chuan sînghnih leh sângli an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thla sâwmnaa sipai hotu chu Zera thlah Netophath mi Maharaia a ni a; a pâwlah chuan sînghnih leh sângli an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thla sâwm leh thla khatnaa sipai hotu chu Ephraima thlah Pirathon mi Benaia a ni a; a pâwlah chuan sînghnih leh sângli an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thla sâwm leh thla hnihnaa sipai hotu chu Othniela thlah Netophath mi Heldaia a ni a; a pâwlah chuan sînghnih leh sângli an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chûng lo pawh chu, Israel hnamho chunga Reuben-hote zîngah chuan Zikria fapa Eliezera chu rorêltu a ni a; Simeon-ho zîngah Maaka fapa Sephatia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Levi-ho zîngah Kemuela fapa Hasabia; Arnon-ho zîngah Zadoka;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Juda-ho zîngah Davida unaute zînga mi Elihua; Isakar-ho zîngah Mikaela fapa Omria;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zebulun-ho zîngah Obadia fapa Ismaia; Naphtali-ho zîngah Azriela fapa Jerimotha;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ephraima thlahte zîngah Azazia fapa Hosea; Manase hnam zâtvete zîngah Pedaia fapa Joela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gilead rama Manase hnam zâtvete zîngah Zekaria fapa Idova; Benjamin-ho zîngah Abnera fapa Jaasiela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dan-ho zîngah Jerohama fapa Azarela. Chûngte chu Israel hnam hotute an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Davida chuan kum sawmhnih achin hnuai lam chu a chhiar lo va, Israel-hote chu vâna arsi zât khian a la tipung ang tih Lalpan a lo sawi tawh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zeruii fapa Joaba chuan a han chhiar ṭan a; nimahsela, a chhiar zo lo va, Israel-te chungah thinurna a lo thleng ta a; Lal Davida lal lai chanchin ziakna buah a zât ziak a ni bawk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lal sum enkawltu chu Adiela fapa Azmavetha a ni a; tin, lo lamah te, khawpuiah te, khawperah te, in sângtea sum enkawltu chu Uzia fapa Jonathana a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lova leileh hna thawkho enkawltu chu Keluba fapa Ezria a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Grêp huan enkawltu chu Ramath mi Simeia a ni a; tin, grêp huana mi uain sâwr dah khâwmna enkawltu chu Siphmit mi Zabdia a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Phai ruama olive thing leh theipui kûngte enkawltu chu Geder mi Baal-hanana a ni a; tin, hriak dah khâwmna enkawltu chu Joasa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Saron-a tla ran rual enkawltu chu Saron mi Sitraia a ni a; ruama ran rual enkawltu chu Adlaia fapa Saphata a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sanghâwngsei enkawltu chu Ismael mi Obila a ni a; tin, sabengtung enkawltu chu Meronoth mi Jehdeia a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />tin, berâm rual enkawltu chu Hagar mi Jaziza a ni. Chûng zawng zawng chu Lal Davida sum enkawltute an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Davida pami, mi fing, lehkha thiam tak Jonathana chu remruattu a ni a; tin, Hakmonia fapa Jehiela chu lal fapate zirtîrtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahithophela chu lal remruatpuitu a ni a; tin, Ark mi Husaia chu lal ṭhian a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahithophela dawtah chuan Benaia fapa Jehoiada leh Abiathara an ni a; tin, lal sipaiho hotu chu Joaba a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Davidan Israel hotu zawng zawng: hnam puipa te, lal rawngbâwla inthlâk ṭhîn pâwl hotu te, sipai sâng hotu te, za hotu te, lal leh a fapate sum leh thil neih zawng zawng chunga hotu te, mi lian leh mi chak, mi chak huaisen zawng zawngte nên Jerusalem-ah a ko khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, Lal Davida chu a ding a, “Ka unaute leh ka mite u, ka thu hi lo ngaithla teh u: kei chuan Lalpa thuthlunna bâwm dahna leh kan Pathian ke nghahchhan tûr in sa ila tih ka lo rilrûk ṭhîn a; tin, sakna tûr pawh ka ngah tawh diam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathianin ka hnênah, ‘Nang zawng indo mi, thisen chhuah mi i nih avângin ka hming tân in i sa lo vang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathianin ka pa chhûngte zawng zawng zîng ata Israel-te lala kumkhuaa awm tûrin mi lo thlang ta a, Juda hnam chu puipa atân a lo thlang ta si a. Tin, Juda hnam zîngah pawh ka pa chhûngte leh ka pa fapate zîng ata Israel zawng zawng lalah mi lo thlang chhuak ta bîk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, ka fapa zawng zawng zîngah chuan (Lalpan fapa tam tak mi pe a) Israel-te lal atân Lalpa ram lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu tûrin ka fapa Solomona hi a lo thlang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tichuan, ka hnênah, ‘I fapa Solomonan ka in leh ka kawtlaite chu a din ang; ka fapa atân ka thlang tawh a; tichuan, a pa ka ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka thupêkte leh ka rorêlte a pawm reng chuan tûna in tih reng ang hian a ram chu kumkhua atân ka tinghet ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa mipui, Israel-ho zawng zawng mit hmuhah leh kan Pathian hriatah hian, Lalpa in Pathian thupêk zawng zawng hi pawm tûr leh ngaihven tûrin ka fuih a che u; tichuan, he ram ṭha tak hi in luah ang a, in hnua in thlahte kumkhua atân in rochun chhâwntîr zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tin, nang ka fapa Solomon, i pa Pathian hi hria la, thinlung ṭha famkim leh rilru phûr takin a rawng bâwl ang che; Lalpa chuan thinlung a en ṭhîn a, rilrua suangtuah zawng zawngte hi a hre vek a ni; amah i zawn chuan i hmu ang a, i hawisan erawh chuan kumkhuain a thlauthla ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Fîmkhur rawh khai; hmun thianghlim tûr in sa tûrin Lalpan a lo ruat tâk che hi; chak takin awm la, bei rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davida chuan a fapa Solomona chu biak in hulhliap lem te, a in lem te, sum dah khâwmna in lem te, a pindan chungnung lem te, a chhûng pindan lem te, zahngaihna ṭhutphah lem te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a rilrua a suangtuah ang zawng zawng, Lalpa in hung chhûng kawtlai lem te, a vêl pindan zawng zawng lem te, Pathian ina sum dah khâwmna in lem te, thil serh dah khâwmna in lem te chu a pe a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />puithiamte leh Levi-hote a pâwl pâwla an awmna tûr lem te, Lalpa ina rawngbâwlna lam tûr zawng zawng lem te, Lalpa ina rawngbâwlna tûr bungbêl zawng zawng lemte pawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />rawngbâwlna lam atâna bungbêl chi tin, rangkachak bungbêl tûr, rangkachak hman zât tûr te, rawngbâwlna lam atâna tangkaraw bungbel tûr, rangkachak hman zât tûr te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />rangkachak khâwnvâr dahna leh a khâwnvâr tûr rangkachak hman zât tûr te, khâwnvâr dahna leh a khâwnvâr tûr zêl atâna hman zât tûr te, khâwnvâr dahnaa hman ṭûlna ṭheuh ang zêla tangkaraw khâwnvâr dahna tûr zêl atâna hman zât tûr te nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />chhang chiahna dawhkân tûr, pakhat zêl atâna rangkachak hman zât tûr te, tangkaraw dawhkân atâna tangkaraw hman zât tûr te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />rangkachak hlîr hlak sa thurna thîr kawm te, maihûn te, note nên; rangkachak berhbu tûr, berhbu pakhat zêl atâna hman zât tûr te, tangkaraw berhbu tûr, berhbu pakhat zêl atâna hman zât tûr te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />rangkachak thianghlima siam, rimtui hâlna maichâm tûr te; cherub-te an thla zâra Lalpa thuthlunna bâwm tuam chuanna lem ang siamna tûr rangkachak te nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Davida chuan, “Hêngte hi tih dân tûr rem a ruat sa tichiang tûra Lalpan ama kut ngeia a ziak ang kha a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Davidan a fapa Solomona hnênah chuan, “Chak tak leh huai takin awm la, bei rawh; hlau suh la, zâm hek suh; Lalpa Pathian, ka Pathian hi i hnênah a awm e. Lalpa in lam hna zawng zawng hi peih vek a nih hma loh chuan a kalsanin a thlahthlam lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, Pathian in hna tinrêng thawktu pâwl puithiamte leh Levi-hote an awm a, eng hna pawha kawng tinrênga hna thiam, châk tak ṭheuhva ṭanpuitu tûr che i hnênah an awm zêl ang a; hotute leh mipui zawng zawng pawhin i thupêk apiang chu an zâwm zêl bawk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lal Davidan mipui zawng zawng hnênah chuan, “Pathian thlan chhuah ka fapa Solomona hi a la naupangin eng mah a la hre rih lo va; a thawh tûr lah chu a ropui si a; biak in chu mihring tân a ni lo va, Lalpa Pathian tân a ni zâwk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, ka Pathian in tân chuan rangkachak lam thil atân rangkachak te, tangkaraw lam thil atân tangkarua te, dâr lam thil atân dâr te, thîr lam thil atân thîr te, thing lam thil atân thingte chu theihtâwpin ka lo buatsaih tawh a; a zeh tûr onuk lung te, lungmawi te, a bel tûr lungmawi chi hrang hrang leh lunghlu chi tinrêng leh sailungvâr lung tam takte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chu chauh lo pawh chu, ka Pathian in hi ka duhsak êm êm mai a, keima sum rangkachak leh tangkaruate pawh, in thianghlim tâna ka lo buatsaih zawng zawng tiam lo hian, ka Pathian in tân ka pe a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />chu chu bangte luan nân Ophir rangkachak, rangkachak talent sângthum leh tangkaraw thianghlim talent sângsarih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />hmanna kawng hrang hranga mi thiamte hman tûrin rangkachak hmanna tûra rangkachak te, tangkaraw hmanna tûra tangkarua te a ni. Vawiin hian Lalpa tâna lâwm taka pe phal tu nge awm le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, chhûngkaw puipate, Israel hnam hotute, sâng hotute leh za hotute, lal hnathawk hotute nên lâwm takin an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian in sak nân rangkachak talent sângnga leh darik sîngkhat, tangkarua talent sîngkhat leh dâr talent sîngkhat leh sângriat, thîr talent nuai khat an pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, lunghlu neite chuan Gerson mi Jehiela vawn Lalpa sumah an dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, mipuite chu an hlim êm êm mai a, rilru hmun khat pua lâwm taka Lalpa an pêk avângin; Lal Davida pawh hlim namên lovin a hlim a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davidan mipui zawng zawng hmaah chuan Lalpa hnênah lâwmthu a sawi a: “Aw Lalpa , kan pu Israela Pathian, chatuana fakin awm rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ropuina te, thiltihtheihna te, chawimawina te, hnehna te, lalna te hi i ta a ni a; lei leh vâna awm zawng zawng hi i ta a ni si a; aw Lalpa , ram chu i ta a ni a, mi zawng zawnga chungnung ber i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hausakna leh chawimawinate hi i hnêna mi a ni a, engkim chungah thu i nei a; tin, thiltihtheihna leh chakna i kutah a awm a; i kutah hian mi zawng zawng tihropuina leh chakna pêk theihna a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, kan Pathian, lâwmthu kan hrilh chia, i hming ropui hi kan fak e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, tu nge maw ka niha, ka mite pawh hi tute nge maw an niha, hetiang te lâwm taka kan lo hlan theih ni le? Thil zawng zawng hi i hnên aṭanga chhuak a ni a, i ta chu kan rawn pe leh mai che a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kan pi leh pute ang khân keini zawng i hmaah hian mikhual, mi hnêna khawsa ve mai ang kan ni a; leilunga kan dam chhûng nite chu hlim ang chauh a ni a, beisei tûr rêng a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aw Lalpa kan Pathian, i hming thianghlim tâna in kan saksakna tûr chea hêng thil kan lo buatsaih zawng zawng hi nangma kutchhuak a ni a, i ta vek a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka Pathian, nangin thinlungte i fiah ṭhîn a, felna te i lâwm ṭhîn tih ka hre bawk. Kei zawngin rilru tak takin hêng thil zawng zawng hi lâwm takin ka rawn hlân a; tin, heta i mite pawh lâwm taka i hnêna rawn hlântu ka hmuh hian ka lâwm êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , kan pu Abrahama te, Isaaka te, Israela te Pathian, i miten hetiang rilru an put reng theihna tûrin an rilrute hi i tân tinghet la;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tin, ka fapa Solomona hi i thupêk te, i thuhriattîr te, i dân te zâwma, chûng zawng zawng ti tûr leh ka lo buatsaih lâwk in sa tûr hian rilru famkim han puttîr ang che,” Davida chuan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Davidan mipui zawng zawng hnênah chuan, “Khai le, Lalpa in Pathian chu fak rawh u,” a ti a. Tichuan, mipui zawng zawng chuan Lalpa , an pi leh pute Pathian chu an fak a, an kûn a, Lalpa leh lal chu chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, a tûkah chuan Lalpa hnênah inthawi nân leh Lalpa hnêna hâlral thilhlan atân, bâwngpa sângkhat leh berâmpa sângkhat leh berâmno sângkhat, an in tûr thilhlante nên Israel-ho zawng zawng tân inthawina tam tak an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, chumi ni chuan Lalpa hmaah hlim takin an ei a, an in hlawm a. Tin, Davida fapa Solomona chu lalah an siam nawn leh a, Lalpa mi lian atân hriak an thih a; tin, Zadoka chu puithiam atân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, Solomona chu Lalpa lalṭhutthlêngah chuan a pa Davida aiah lalah a ṭhu ta a, hmuingîl takin a awm a; tin, Israel-ho zawng zawngin a thu an zâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, hotu zawng zawng leh mi chak huaisente leh Lal Davida fapa dang zawng zawng chu Lal Solomona lakah an intulût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Solomona chu Israel-ho zawng zawng mit hmuhah nasa takin a tiropui a, Israel rama a hmaa lalte zînga tu ma la chan ngai loh, lal nihna ropui tak a chantîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesaia fapa Davida chu Israel-ho zawng zawng chungah a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel-ho chunga a lal chhûng chu kum sawmli a ni; Hebron khuaah kum sarih a lal a, Jerusalem-ah kum sawmthum leh kum thum a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, upa tak, tarkûna damin, hausa tak leh chawimawi hlawhin a thi a; tin, a fapa Solomona chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ngai teh, Lal Davida chanchin chu a tîr aṭanga a tâwp thlengin, zâwlnei Samuela lehkhabuah te, zâwlnei Nathana lehkhabuah te, zâwlnei Gada lehkhabuah te a chuang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />a lal thûte, a thiltihtheihzia zawng zawng te, amah leh Israel-ho leh ram zawng zawng chunga thil lo awm dânte nên.
  </para>
</usx>
